	file.0000000000000001.title: "Reincarnation Guide"
	quest.0063A0184F3307CC.quest_desc: [
		"&f&lLocation: Its core is found in the &f&lCharybdis Cave"
		""
		"Quest Description: A swirling vortex of magical turbulence housed deep within a jagged, wind-swept cavern. The core pulsates with chaotic energy, acting as an anchor for the storm that threatens to tear the surrounding landscape apart."
	]
	quest.0063A0184F3307CC.quest_subtitle: "&0&lThe Disaster of the Skies"
	quest.0063A0184F3307CC.title: "&4&lCharybdis"
	quest.0085F6D08AD85802.quest_desc: [
		"Get someone to use Paralysing Breath on you"
		""
		"If you are playing alone just get one or multiple Evil Centipede to use their Paralysing Breath on you"
		""
		"When toggled, prevents Paralysis damage if it falls below 50% of your Max HP. Also prevents paralysis, slowness and minimg fatigue effects If the attack is not below 50% of your Max HP the damage will be halved."
	]
	quest.0085F6D08AD85802.title: "&#E7A034&lParalysis Resistance"
	quest.008BC147C230097F.title: "&f&lObtain A Lesser Spirit Of Water"
	quest.00A3E2FA459E33CF.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive - Toggle] - When toggled, increases the amount of permanent EP gained when killing a target by 3% for both Aura and Magicule (+6% total), boosted to 7.5% each with Mastery (+15% total)"
		""
		"[Passive - In Slot] - Grants the player's attacks a 50% (75% with Mastery) chance to steal 1% of the target's current MP and restores their MP by that amount."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Press] - When activated on a target with Fear V+ or current EP (not max) below 10% of the user's current EP, kills them and restores the player's EP by the target’s EP (splits 50% AP, 50% MP). This can set you above 100% AP/MP, so do be careful as going higher then 100% can give negative effects, such as Insanity for Aura, and Magicule Poisoning for Magicule. Has a 3.5 block range in front of user."
	]
	quest.00A3E2FA459E33CF.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.00A3E2FA459E33CF.title: "&f&lGourmand"
	quest.00CD4DD89C910DAD.title: "&f&lObtain A Greater Spirit Of Water"
	quest.00DBDCC39EC12A7C.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, Press] Generosity - Create a circle of amplification in front of the user that raises the damage of any projectiles passing through it by 3 times. If a player passes through this gate, they will experience heightened speed and step height for 10 seconds. Every entity or player that passes through this gate contributes to [Pay It Forward]. The user cannot use the gate to amplify themselves or their projectiles/attacks. Only one circle can be active at a time and persists until the user takes it down. Costs 1000 MP to spawn a circle and 500 MP every second it is active. Shift and Use to remove the circle."
		""
		"[Active, Toggle] Pay It Forward - Every Contribution you have gained will be consumed to power up Pay It Forward. The duration of this mode depends on how many Contributions have been made, following this formula (Contributions x 10 seconds)"
		"Toggling off the mode preserves the remaining seconds for future use."
		"When Pay It Forward is active, the user will gain Damage Amplification and hugely boosted Speed and Step Height depending on the number of Contributions counted."
		""
		"30 or more contributions - 2x Damage, +0.1F movement speed and +2 Step Height."
		""
		"50 or more - 3x Damage, +0.15F movement speed and +3 Step Height."
		""
		"100 or more - 5x Damage, +0.2F movement speed and +4 Step Height."
		""
		"500 or more - 10x Damage, +0.5F movement speed and +6 Step Height."
	]
	quest.00DBDCC39EC12A7C.title: "&f&lProvider"
	quest.01377002863B9ABF.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassives"
		"Passive (toggle) - Six Eyes"
		""
		"Reduces the Magicule cost of skills by 25%."
		"At mastery, the reduction increases to 50%."
		"Outlines every entity for the user, granting extreme spatial awareness even through obstructions."
		"While Infinity itself is inactive, external attacks have a 1/15 chance to be completely dodged. (At mastery, the dodge chance improves to 1/10.)"
		"Passive (true) - Prodigy"
		""
		"The user's natural talent accelerates both growth and skill learning."
		""
		"Personally killing an enemy grants bonus EP equal to 2% of that enemy's original maximum EP."
		"When learning another skill, the user gains +3 additional Skill Learning points."
		"Infinity itself does not receive this +3 learning-point bonus."
		""
		"Passive (true) - Honored One"
		""
		"Once per life, a fatal attack is prevented and the user enters the Honored One state."
		""
		"Prevents death and immediately restores the user to full Health and full Magicules."
		"Grants temporary invulnerability during the Honored One sequence."
		"Lasts about 7 sec."
		"Can activate only once per life and resets after respawning."
		""
		"Passive (true) - Reverse Cursed Technique"
		""
		"If the user has at least 1 Magicule and is injured, heals 3 HP every second."
		"Does not consume Magicules."
		""
		"&0&lActives"
		"Active (hold / toggle when mastered) - Infinity"
		""
		"Creates an untouchable spatial field around the user that progressively slows anything attempting to reach them."
		""
		"Begins interfering with approaching threats within about 8 blocks."
		"Living entities are slowed more and more as they approach."
		"Near the user, their inward movement is reduced to an extreme crawl."
		"Living entities are physically prevented from crossing the final 2-block gap around the user. (Projectiles as well)"
		"External attack damage is nullified while Infinity is active unless the attack qualifies to bypass it."
		"Entities with at least 20% more EP than the user are unaffected by Infinity."
		"Severance attacks shatter Infinity, are not nullified by the barrier, and place Infinity on a 60-sec cooldown."
		"Upkeep:"
		"Normal: 10% of maximum Magicules every 5 sec."
		"Mastered: 8% of maximum Magicules every 20 sec."
		""
		"Active (press / hold) - Lapse: Blue"
		""
		"Creates a spatial attraction point from the user's right side that pulls surrounding enemies in."
		""
		"Can be tapped for an immediate launch or held for up to 3 sec to charge."
		"While charging, Blue already pulls nearby enemies toward the growing sphere."
		"Charging increases the sphere's size, attraction radius, and damage."
		"Damage scales with EP and charge, from a base of 150 up to a maximum of 500."
		"Maximum damage scaling is reached around 350,000 EP with a full charge."
		"Maximum travel range: 24 blocks."
		"Base cost: 6,000 Magicules."
		"With Six Eyes: 4,500 Magicules normally / 3,000 when mastered."
		"Cooldown: 120 sec."
		""
		"Active (press / hold) - Reversal: Red"
		""
		"Creates an immense repulsive force from the user's left side that blasts targets away."
		""
		"Can be tapped for an immediate launch or held for up to 3 sec to charge."
		"While charging, Red already pushes nearby enemies away from the shrinking sphere."
		"Charging makes Red smaller, stronger, and more concentrated."
		"Damage scales with EP and charge, from a base of 200 up to a maximum of 650."
		"Maximum damage scaling is reached around 350,000 EP with a full charge."
		"Maximum travel range: 32 blocks."
		"Base cost: 7,000 Magicules."
		"With Six Eyes: 5,250 Magicules normally / 3,500 when mastered."
		"Cooldown: 150 sec normally / 120 sec when mastered."
		"Active (press - requires mastery) - Hollow Technique: Purple"
		""
		"Combines Lapse: Blue and Reversal: Red into the strongest spatial technique available to Infinity."
		""
		"Requires mastery."
		"Blue and Red appear on their respective sides and converge into a growing Purple mass in front of the user before launch."
		"After the fusion sequence, Purple launches forward and tears through everything in its path."
		"Deals Severance damage to each valid target it passes through."
		"Damage scales with EP from 300 up to a maximum of 900."
		"Maximum damage scaling is reached around 500,000 EP."
		"Maximum travel range: 10 blocks."
		"Resistance bypassed/nullification is defreded, barrier bypass, bypasses dodge"
		"Base cost: 50,000 Magicules."
		"With Six Eyes active, the mastered user pays 25,000 Magicules."
		"Cooldown: 12 minutes."
		"Purple can destroy nearby terrain along its path when Infinity Purple block damage is enabled in the config"
		"Unbreakable blocks are not destroyed."
	]
	quest.01377002863B9ABF.title: "&f&lInfinity"
	quest.0166E78F39261F00.quest_desc: ["Craftable"]
	quest.019039DF344166F3.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive, Toggle] Teravolt:"
		"Increases the damage of Lighting-based attacks by 2x. Stacks with Lightning Manipulation and Lightning Domination."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, Press] Bolt Strike:"
		"On activation, the user summons a massive bolt of lightning at the targeted location, dealing 50 electricity and 50 physical damage to those unfortunate enough to be caught in its wake. Cooldown of 10 seconds, reducing to 5 on mastery."
		""
		"[Active, Held] Fusion Bolt:"
		"The user charges up lightning, letting it surround them as they charge towards their enemy. The user then hits their target with all the charged lightning. dealing both 30 Physical and 30 Electric Damage. This costs 500 Magicules."
		""
		"If you have Unique Skill [Reshiram] in slot, it summons flames around your target as well as you hit them, dealing 40 Flame Damage, if this happens, the cost is increased to 700 Magicules."
		""
		"20 second cooldown for this mode."
		""
		"[Active, Held] Draconic Breath:"
		"Costs 240 MP per second while this is held down. The user lets out a draconic breath of purple flames from their mouth, blasting your enemies with it. Grants enemies the Paralysis effect and deals 60 magic damage on contact. 10 Second CD"
		""
		"[Active, Press] Thunderbolt:"
		"Costs 250 MP. The user summons lightning where they are looking, dealing 60 Electricity damage."
	]
	quest.019039DF344166F3.title: "&f&lZekrom"
	quest.0210788B5D17F51C.title: "&f&lSchematic Harvenger"
	quest.024621EBB344FBB7.quest_desc: ["Create is going to help you advance. Take these low nuggets and begin the creation progression"]
	quest.024621EBB344FBB7.quest_subtitle: "Now you Can! Check Creation tab"
	quest.024621EBB344FBB7.title: "Nice I wounder If I will be able to manufacture this myself?"
	quest.024CCCD1C56F8F32.title: "&0&lInfinite Wisdom"
	quest.0299624E4C8ABA10.quest_desc: ["By dropping fule type objects (wood, coal, etc) will be consumed and produce source"]
	quest.02B7188DD1499B0C.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive, In-Slot] By Design:"
		"Increases the amount of points gained when learning skills by 6."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, Press] Copy:"
		"When Pressed, the user will begin to copy skills from the target. This Copy will store all skills within [ Skill Designer ]. This skill can copy Resistances, Common and Extra Skills."
		""
		"[Active, Press] Skill Designer"
		"When Pressed, the user opens up the Skill Designer GUI. Any skill copied by Copy, will appear in Skill Designer. You can produce any stored skill as a Temporary Skill, for Current MP, or as a permanant skill, for twice its MP cost."
		""
		"[Active, Pressed] Recycle:"
		"When Pressed, the user opens the Recycle GUI. Any Skill the users owns, can be \"Recycled\" here. Recycling the skill will grant you its Magicule Cost, while there is a 5% Chance (10% Chance when mastered) to gain 10% (20% when mastered) more MP than the skills original cost."
		"- If used on Unique Skills, you'll gain a small amount of Soul Energy instead of bonus MP."
		"-- If used on Ultimate Skills, this will give you the exact amount of SE it is worth."
	]
	quest.02B7188DD1499B0C.title: "&f&lDesigner"
	quest.0328C37D80A11781.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive, Toggle] Thought Acceleration"
		""
		"[Passive, In-Slot] Detect Weakness - While this skill is in slot, entities you hit will progress the production of your Lethal Dose."
		""
		"&0&lActives"
		"[Active, In-Slot] Bloody Bite - The user strikes at an enemy, spending some of their MP to inject them with their Poison. If the Detect Weakness is at 30% of less, this move only deals Physical and Spiritual Damage. (Halved by Abnormal Condition Resistance, reduced by 25% with Nullification). If Detect Weakness is at 50%, it infects them with Magicule Poisoning. If Detect Weakness is at 80%, it becomes Lethal Poison. If it is at 100%, it becomes Cursed Poison."
		""
		"[Active, Held] Poison Refinement - While Held, this move will slowly drain the user's MP and begin producing 2.5% (5% on mastery) of the progress for your Lethal Dose a second."
		""
		"[Active, Press] Deadly Domain - This can only be used when your Lethal Dose is at 100%. All Non-Spiritual Beings will take 500 SHP damage (1000 on mastery), and all Spiritual Lifeforms take 250 (500 on mastery) and your Lethal Dose is reduced to 0."
		""
		"[Active, Press] Cursed Poison (Requires Mastery, Requires Learning) - The user can infect a target with Cursed Poison for 5 minutes."
		""
		"&6&lCursed Poison Effect"
		"Cursed Poison is a Status Effect that deals both 25 HP and SHP damage per second each level. If you kill a entity while they are infected with Cursed Posion, you gain 10% more EP from it instead"
	]
	quest.0328C37D80A11781.title: "&f&lDeadly Poison"
