	quest.07A6BE68A11FDC5D.quest_subtitle: "&f&lTips"
	quest.07A6BE68A11FDC5D.title: "&#B03ABB&lPoison Resistance"
	quest.07D578AC9C445EA0.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive - In Slot] - Absolute Guard : Blocks all attacks with a formula of C = A * 25. C = Cost, A = Attack Damage. Attacks from an opponent with 75% or higher the user's EP can bypass it."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Press] - Imprison: At the cost of 30,000MP, imprisons the mob/player the player is looking at. Seals all movement, skill usage and healing. Drains MP from the trapped target at a rate of 500 per 10 ticks. Lasts for 300 seconds. Increases to 600 seconds with mastery - 20s cooldown - Goes on CD if you Miss (10s with Mastery)."
		""
		"[Active - Press] - Imaginary Space : Open a Spatial Storage with the size of a chest with 9x10 rows. Items are able to be stacked to 999 instead of 64. Stores the energy (MP Cost) of attacks blocked by Absolute Guard"
	]
	quest.07D578AC9C445EA0.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.07D578AC9C445EA0.title: "&f&lInfinity Prison"
