		"Go to the Spirit Tree and let other player hit you with Heat Wave"
		""
		"If you are playing alone go fight Shizu, she can also use Heat Wave or fight Ifrit, as every Flame Attack, also deals heat damage."
		""
		"When toggled, prevents damage from Heat if it falls below 50% of your Max HP. If the attack is not below 50% of your Max HP the damage will be halved."
	]
	quest.083EB97CDD93912D.quest_subtitle: "&f&lTips"
	quest.083EB97CDD93912D.title: "&#FF5724&lHeat Resistance"
