	quest.16C75080E8316165.title: "&f&lRoyal Blood"
	quest.172C436A115FEB31.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive - Toggle] Substitution : The player takes damage in place of their subordinates [Not working for Spiritual Damage or damage dealt by the owner]"
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Press] Grant Protection : Grants all nearby subordinates/allies 10 extra armor points and 30 barrier points for 180 seconds. Costs 100 MP"
		""
		"[Active - Toggle] Iron Wall : Grants the player an additional 15 (40 with Mastery) Armour Points and 0.4 (1 with Mastery) Knockback Resistance."
	]
	quest.172C436A115FEB31.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.172C436A115FEB31.title: "&f&lGuardian"
	quest.187F065D290F89BF.quest_desc: ["The Ultimates seen in this chapter are the only ones missing from the tensura wiki book. Please refer to the book for the ultimates you dont see here."]
	quest.187F065D290F89BF.quest_subtitle: "&f&lInfo"
	quest.187F065D290F89BF.title: "&4&lUltimate Info"
	quest.188F7B79706864CD.quest_desc: [
		"&5&lMakes Gravity Manipulation Learnable."
		""
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive - Toggle] Makes the player immune to fall damage and simple projectile (arrow, trident, kunai,...) with mastery [Toggle]. Repel, Attract, and Flicker are able to have their ranges manually selected with keys with mastery (0 = Hold like normal)"
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Hold] - Repel: Repels the mob the player is looking at, pushing them away. The longer its held before releasing, the bigger the distance. Costs 50 MP"
		""
		"[Active - Hold] - Attract: Attracts the mob the player is looking at, pulling them towards the player. The length its held down before releasing determines the distance pulled. Costs 50 MP"
		""
		"[Active - Press] - Oppress: Traps the mob the player is looking at inside a gravity field that reduces their speed and jump strength to 5% as well as applying Burden 2 for 30 seconds. Each 10 seconds, add 1 level of insanity. If activated again while a mob is trapped, deals 100 (200 with Mastery) Damage (can be done repeatedly). Trapping a Mob costs 300 MP, dealing damage costs 700 MP. Cooldown 10s (5s if mastered)"
		""
		"[Active - Press] - Bleve: Deals 100(200 with mastery) damage at the cost of 1000 MP to the mob the player is looking at and knocks them 10 blocks into the air."
		""
		"[Active - Hold] - Flicker: Pushes the player forward at high speed. The longer the button is held the farther they go when the button is released. Costs 50 MP."
	]
	quest.188F7B79706864CD.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.188F7B79706864CD.title: "&f&lOppressor"
	quest.18AB28116FC852B5.title: "&f&lMove Up To Class D"
	quest.18B1E46AD2D6E3AA.title: "&f&lTrue Protection"
	quest.18E323CBFA5D4F18.quest_desc: [
		"&f&lLocation: Found in a large chamber at the bottom of the Cursed Pyramid in Desert biomes."
		""
		"Quest Description: A massive skeletal dinosaur wearing a Pharaoh’s headdress. You must use the Necklace of the Desert to wake it. It summons sandstorms and anvils from the sky to crush its intruders."
	]
	quest.18E323CBFA5D4F18.quest_subtitle: "&0&lThe Desert’s Fossilized King"
	quest.18E323CBFA5D4F18.title: "&4&lThe Ancient Remnant"
