		""
		"- Reset Counter"
		""
		"- 1k Adventurers Exp"
		""
		"- World Class"
	]
	quest.194DD27AED71DD88.title: "&#5C0204&lTrial of Strength"
	quest.19DF03B62D1E6246.quest_desc: [
		"Go to the Spirit Tree and get another player to hit you with Earth Spikes"
		"If you are playing alone your best option would be to fight the War Gnome (Greater Earth Elemental) that Hinata summons or plunder it from a Beast Gnome (Medium Earth Elemental)"
		""
		"When toggled, prevents Earth damage if it falls below 50% of your Max HP. If the attack is not below 50% of your Max HP the damage will be halved."
	]
	quest.19DF03B62D1E6246.quest_subtitle: "&f&lTips"
	quest.19DF03B62D1E6246.title: "&#FFAA00&lEarth Attack Resistance"
	quest.1A4E55AB6D7A920E.quest_desc: [
		"&f&5Become Blessed upon obtaining Chosen One"
		""
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive - True] Hero’s Beacon (Unlocked with Mastery): All Skills, and Battlewill owned by a subordinate become the player's when they are killed (does not count if they are killed by the user)."
		""
		"[Passive - Toggle] Hero’s Action : Hero of the Village V Effect"
		""
		"[Passive - In Slot] Hero’s Blessing : Grants a permanent Luck 5 effect. The player and their allies have a 100% critical hit rate and a 10% auto-dodge chance."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Hold] Hero’s Haki: 25 MP per 20 ticks. When activated, all mobs within a 30x30 radius are affected, If their EP is =<75% of the user's used EP, it does nothing. Otherwise, give 1 Fear level for each 20% difference with the used EP"
		""
		"[Active - Press] Hero’s Charisma : When activated, all passive and neutral mobs within a 20x20 radius will be treated as the player's allies and will assist them in combat for 120s [Negated by Spiritual Attack Nullification, reduced to 60s by Resistance]. When Hero's Charisma is in slot, any mobs they or the player defeat will be resurrected as allies with half max health (Except Undead). Costs 200 MP"
	]
	quest.1A4E55AB6D7A920E.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.1A4E55AB6D7A920E.title: "&f&lChosen One"
	quest.1AB4F822A5560391.quest_subtitle: "&fHas a 30 min cooldown"
	quest.1AFF19F3857C8ACD.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Press] - Heal: Fully restores all HP at the cost of 80 MP (40 with Mastery) per HP. Fully restores all Spiritual HP at the cost of 60 MP per HP (Requires Mastery). If used while not looking at a target, applies to the player [Also remove Virus from the user], if used while looking at a target it heals them instead (require sneaking to heal others). [Physical Healing is done first, with MP cost - then to spiritual HP]"
		""
		"[Active - Press] - Infection: Applies the Infection debuff to the looked at target [Cure Virus if the target already has the effect]. Costs 100 MP."
		""
		"[Active - Hold] - Plague [Requires Mastery]: Applies the Infection debuff to everything in a 15x15 radius. Costs 300 MP."
	]
	quest.1AFF19F3857C8ACD.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.1AFF19F3857C8ACD.title: "&f&lHealer"
	quest.1B60612EED075A0B.quest_desc: [
		"/kickme - Kicks yourself from server (in case the bed bug ever returns)"
		""
		"/trashcan - Opens an inventory where items get deleted when placed in and closed"
		""
		"/back - Teleports to previous location. Can be used multiple times"
		""
		"/spawn - Teleports you to spawn"
		""
		"/rtp - Teleports you to random location in world, tries to find a non-ocean, safe place to land"
		""
		" "
		""
		"/home [name] - Teleports to a home"
		""
		"/sethome <name> - Sets home"
		""
		"/delhome <name> - Deletes a home"
		""
		"/listhomes [player] - Lists all player homes"
		""
		" "
		""
		"/warp <name> - Teleports to a warp"
		""
		"/setwarp <name> - Sets warp"
		""
		"/delwarp <name> - Deletes a warp"
		""
		"/listwarps - Lists all warps"
		""
		" "
		""
		"/tpa <player> - Requests teleportation to player"
		""
		"/tpahere <player> - Requests player to teleport to you"
		""
		"/tpaccept <id> - Accepts request (will have a button for it on screen)"
		""
		"/tpadeny <id> - Denies request (will have a button for it on screen)"
	]
	quest.1B60612EED075A0B.quest_subtitle: "/ CMDs"
	quest.1B8681DDE6F76349.quest_subtitle: "&fYou will need that other one later"
	quest.1C3AB3F8D73076FD.quest_desc: [
		"&f&lLocation: Found in tall, dark towers within Cold/Tundra biomes."
		""
		"Quest Description: A skeletal horror is gathering souls in the frozen wastes. Find the decaying tower in the tundra and use a Soul Star to summon this lich. Be wary, it will not yield its power easily."
	]
	quest.1C3AB3F8D73076FD.quest_subtitle: "&0&lThe Soul-Harvesting Tyrant"
	quest.1C3AB3F8D73076FD.title: "&4&lThe Night Lich"
	quest.1D097FFFEA42CAD4.quest_desc: [
		"&5&lMastery is gained passively"
		""
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive - Toggle] Death Benefit - Upon killing an enemy, receive 4% of its EP. 2% as Magicule and 2% as Aura. This stacks with the base 3% given to ordinary players on killing a mob, for a total of 7%"
		""
		"[Passive - In Slot] Equipment Destruction - The user's attacks passively deal double damage to armour durability. Attacks against the user take up double durability from their weapon."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Press] Diamond Body - When activated, grants the user an Armor and ** Physical Damage (Hand, Sword, Spear, Axe) buff temporarily. The buff scales to the user's current max ep and does not consume any of the user's ep to activate:"
		""
		"Attack Damage (x2 with Mastery): 5 base then add one 1 more for each 40k EP (stops at 2M EP)"
		""
		"Armor: 1 for each 20k EP (stops at 2M EP)"
		""
		"Speed: 0.01 for each 25k EP (stops at 1M EP)"
	]
	quest.1D097FFFEA42CAD4.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.1D097FFFEA42CAD4.title: "&f&lBerserker"
	quest.1D1B43355D795DB5.quest_desc: ["A high-speed, explosive dash. Raw movement speed and sudden repositioning are vital for dodging massive area-of-effect skills."]
	quest.1D1B43355D795DB5.title: "&f&lBurning Dash"
	quest.1D5D9315C13C65DC.quest_desc: ["These Boss Structurs spwan bosses. After killing them, they will respawn after an hour."]
	quest.1D5D9315C13C65DC.quest_subtitle: "&f&lImportant"
	quest.1D5D9315C13C65DC.title: "&f&0Boss Structures"
	quest.1E0102F2A5597E31.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive - Toggle] Instinctual Avoidance: 20% Chance to auto-dodge melee attacks. 100% chance to auto-dodge thrown projectiles (arrows, kunai, etc)"
		""
		"[Passive - In Slot in this mode] Danger Detection: Like Danger Sense"
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active] Presence Detection: Upon holding down, boosts the user’s Presence Sense Level by 1 and Presence Sense Distance by 20 blocks. If activated while sneaking down, cycle through the available Presence Sense mode:"
		"--All: Like any Presence Sense ability - Highlights all mobs in sensing radius in blue, even invisible ones or ones under the effect of concealing abilities."
		""
		"--Monsters: Highlights any monsters in sensing radius in certain colors: [Neutral: Yellow, Enemy: Red]"
		""
		"--Trap: Highlights any trap blocks in halved sensing radius in red. [Trap blocks: Lava, Pointed Dripstone, Tripwire, Sculk Sensor, Sculk Shrieker, Cobweb, Powder Snow, Trapped Chest, TNT, TNT Minecart, End Crystal]."
		""
		"--Treasure: Available with Mastery, highlights any treasure blocks in halved sensing radius in gold. [Treasure blocks: Chest, Barrel, Vault, Dragon Egg, Ancient Debris and Magic Ore, Charybdis Core]."
	]
	quest.1E0102F2A5597E31.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.1E0102F2A5597E31.title: "&f&lObserver"
	quest.1E29A3B193EEEE67.quest_desc: [
		"Safely and securely exchange items between two players. Just right click each other (make sure both participants have an empty hand) and the GUI opens up. "
		""
		"Click the \"Ready\" button (symbol of cross-arrows) in the middle to indicate you've locked in your side of the trade, and when both players do so the trade will be complete. "
		""
		"Can also do /playertrade <playername> command, which allows for infinite range trading"
	]
	quest.1E29A3B193EEEE67.quest_subtitle: "Safe Trade"
	quest.1E29A3B193EEEE67.title: "&f&lPLAYER TRADING"
	quest.1E71DE4AF71E187A.title: "Collect"
