	quest.1F60B26938D69AC5.quest_subtitle: "If you lack a physical body or want to posses a more durable vessle this (and its veriants) are very useful items"
	quest.1F60B26938D69AC5.title: "No Body No Problem"
	quest.1F9B68AA0A4F7789.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive, True] Nine Lives:"
		"The player can respawn up to nine times if the world is set to hardcore. Check current lives using /tensura get ability check mysticism:schrodinger."
		""
		"[Passive, True] Dead or Alive:"
		"There is a 50% chance that the user does not lose Energy (and by extension, souls) when dying."
		""
		"[Passive, Toggle] Feline Instincts:"
		"The player's safe falling distance has been increased by 32 blocks. This means you will need to fall 32 blocks before you start taking half a heart of fall damage, etc. etc."
		""
		"[Passive, In Slot] Poison Touch:"
		"On hurting an enemy, apply Poison II to the target. On mastery, this becomes Fatal Poison II."
	]
	quest.1F9B68AA0A4F7789.title: "&f&lSchrodinger"
	quest.2067DCE7C01C8F9E.quest_desc: [
		"The same as Researcher, but can store Engravings[1] and take enchantments from enchanted or engraved gear. Additionally, items can be stacked to 256 in Spatial Storage. The max level of enchantment stored can be 2 levels higher than enchantments cap"
		""
		"i.e. Sharpness 7 compared to Vanilla Sharpness 5 (Will need a book or item with said enchantment to store at that level)"
	]
	quest.2067DCE7C01C8F9E.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.2067DCE7C01C8F9E.title: "&f&lGodly Craftsman"
	quest.2090E1EA65B198ED.quest_desc: ["Reaching F rank will unlock the shop"]
	quest.2090E1EA65B198ED.quest_subtitle: "Can I Prove Myself"
	quest.2090E1EA65B198ED.title: "&f&lBecome F Rank"
	quest.20D8EC32F0219F3C.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive, Toggle] Turboblaze - Increases damage of all Fire-based attacks by 2x. Stacks with Flame Manipulation and Flame Domination."
		""
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, Press] Blue Flare - On activation, the user surrounds the area they are looking at in blue flames dealing 60 damage for as long as targets stay inside it. On impact, it creates a 20x20 zone. Cooldown of 10 seconds, 5 with mastery. Costs 400 MP to use."
		"[Active, Press] Fusion Flare - Costs 400 MP to use. The user strikes where they are looking with a massive flame, scorching all those trapped, pulling them towards the center of it dealing 40 Flame attack damage per second, lasting 5 seconds."
		"If the user has the Unique Skill [Zekrom] in slot, additionally summon lightning down to strike the user’s target, dealing 40 Electricity Damage, if this happens, the cost is increased to 700 MP. 20 Second CD"
		""
		"[Active, Press] Draconic Meteor - Costs 400 Magicules to use. Using draconic power, the user forms a meteor and brings it down from the sky, striking down at the targeted zone dealing 70 Magic Damage, destroying surrounding blocks and knocking everything back. 20 second cooldown."
		"[Active, Hold] Flamethrower - Cost 70 Magicules per second while active. Works like Flame Breath, instead dealing 30 fire damage each second."
	]
	quest.20D8EC32F0219F3C.title: "&f&lReshiram"
	quest.213FDE17BA15A628.quest_desc: [
		"&f&lLocation: Spawns in a rare underground structure at the bottom of the world (deep caves near Bedrock)."
		""
		"Quest Description: Deep within the roots of the world, a parasitic plant has grown fat on void energy. Follow the Void Lilies in the deepest caves to find its lair and cut it down before its spikes consume the bedrock."
	]
	quest.213FDE17BA15A628.quest_subtitle: "&0&lThe Abyssal Overgrowth"
	quest.213FDE17BA15A628.title: "&4&lThe Void Blossom"
	quest.215BC919390499B9.quest_desc: ["Converts lava to power"]
	quest.215BC919390499B9.title: "&f&lMagmator"
	quest.216201AA556DEA29.quest_subtitle: "Only S Class and above can purchase this"
	quest.217C319D08955D46.quest_desc: ["Grip an entity and physically throw them across the battlefield. Incredible utility for dragging slippery ranged bosses down to melee distance."]
	quest.217C319D08955D46.title: "&f&lTelekinesis"
	quest.21974AF9F407DB1D.quest_desc: [
		"Combine a block of gold, 3 blocks of pure magisteel, and a sunflower in an energizing orb. "
		""
		"&0&lRequires 7 Million FE"
	]
	quest.21974AF9F407DB1D.title: "&6&lThe Axe Adored By The Sun"
	quest.222D586CAC3DEF9F.quest_desc: [
		"&f&lLocation: Found on the lowest level of the Ruined Citadel in the outer End islands."
		""
		"Quest Description: The final sentinel of the End. Upon approaching the central altar, it will shatter the floor, dragging you into a massive boss arena. It uses void energy to attract its prey and protect its core until its helmet is broken."
	]
	quest.222D586CAC3DEF9F.quest_subtitle: "&0&lThe Citadel’s Last Stand"
	quest.222D586CAC3DEF9F.title: "&4&lThe Ender Guardian"
	quest.2276AF873A04BD88.quest_subtitle: "Only E rank and above can purchase this"
	quest.228DE96B33B5E8D2.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, Press] Skill Optimization: Open up a menu that lists skills the user has and are able to alter. Selecting a skill will replace or add onto one of its abilities."
		""
		"[Active, Press] Attribute Optimize: Have a 1.5x multiplier on 3 base attributes. When not mastered, only applies to max health, armor, and attack speed. When mastered, if used while shifting, it instead applies to SHP, Magicules, and aura. It does not regenerate them to that level."
	]
	quest.228DE96B33B5E8D2.title: "&f&lHandler"
	quest.2297F1EF2C140E7B.quest_desc: [
		"&6&l10% drop chance from Medium Elementals and Elemental Colossus"
		"Elemental Colossus"
		"Beast Gnome"
		"Salamander"
		"Aqua Frog"
		"Feathered Serpent"
		"Winged Cat"
		""
		"&6&l100% drop chance from Greater Elementals"
		"Akash"
		"Ifrit"
		"Sylphide"
		"Undine"
		"War Gnome"
		""
		"&4&lCannot be obtained by any spirits summoned with the Summoning skills"
	]
	quest.2297F1EF2C140E7B.quest_subtitle: "&fObtainment"
	quest.2297F1EF2C140E7B.title: "&f&lElemental Essence"
	quest.22AFE7031CFB2DC0.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Sub-Skill] Cold Clay - The user will learn Flame Attack Resistance when Malleable is acquired."
		""
		"[Passive, Toggle] Memory Material - All resistances are learned 5x faster, and so are earth type magics/abilities. They are also mastered 5x faster."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, Press] Alchemy - Cycle through 13 different modes; Physical, Fire, Ice, Lightning, Piercing, Earth, Water, Light, Dark, Holy, Poison, Corrosion, and Wind. Similar to Magic Aura, change any damage dealt from the player to this damage type. Upon mastery, becomes a toggle. 10 second cooldown."
		""
		"[Active, Held] Harden - While holding this skill, disable flight, movement, the ability to attack, and spatial moves, and give yourself regeneration 5 and resistance 2, alongside 10 armor points. After releasing, put the skill on cooldown for 120 seconds (60 seconds on mastery) and give weakness 2 and slowness 2 for 30 seconds."
		""
		"[Active, Press] Vessel - Summon a clay golem with 40 max health, with no AI, allowing it to be possessed by anyone who's able to. If another player possesses it, they become a temporary subordinate until they leave the body/die. Maximum of 2 may exist. On mastery, increases the max health of the Vessel to 200."
	]
	quest.22AFE7031CFB2DC0.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.22AFE7031CFB2DC0.title: "&f&lMalleable"
	quest.22ED543BE73B1014.quest_desc: [
		"&f&lLocation: Found deep underwater in the Sunken City dungeon."
		""
		"Quest Description: Something massive and corrupted lurks in the abandoned cities of the ocean floor. It is a multi-phase beast that can easily shrug off standard end-game weapons. Prepare for a high-pressure fight in the crushing dark."
	]
	quest.22ED543BE73B1014.quest_subtitle: "&0&lThe Abyssal Horror"
	quest.22ED543BE73B1014.title: "&4&lThe Leviathan"
	quest.2327B5B60C276554.quest_desc: ["&f&lEmpty"]
	quest.2327B5B60C276554.title: "&f&lEndorse"
	quest.2375C5A9CFB02D13.quest_subtitle: "Dang Now you are strong"
	quest.2375C5A9CFB02D13.title: "Chapter 2 Completionist"
	quest.2382ECA675D00945.quest_subtitle: "This is where the current Create jurney ends, more in the future!!!"
	quest.2382ECA675D00945.title: "&f&lYou Created Magic Ore!!!!!!!!!"
	quest.238886D2C2F4B356.title: "&e&lOriginal Angel Race"
	quest.239014E4F1A3937C.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive - Toggle] - Parallel Processing: Increases the amount of Learned Points and Mastery Points gained when learning/using Skills, Magic, Battlewill, and Arts by 9 (10 Total)."
		""
		"[Passive - Toggle] - Chant Annulment: For Mastered Magic, completely fills up the Magic Circle's MP meter instantly."
		""
		"[Passive - Toggle] - Thought Acceleration"
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Press] - Analytical Appraisal: Analysis Level 2, distance 20 blocks (30 with Mastery), If a target has greater than 5x (10x with Mastery) the player's EP, then only its base stats are shown (Name, HP, SHP, Armor)."
		""
		"[Active] - Analysis: When used while looking at a mob, copies 1 of the Magic, and Skills (Except Unique Skills and Resistances) of a target. Can copy from up to 20 blocks away while in line of sight of entity or magic circle and won't work on any spirit related magic. Ineffective against Ultimate Skill Users. 25% Chance at Success, which raises to 50% with Mastery - 10s cooldown (5s if failed)."
		""
		"[Active] - Refining: Opens a GUI that can be used to craft things, brew potions and process magic ore"
		""
		"---Crafting tab: Works like a normal crafting table. Put an item in the replication slot on the left, to craft that item like a smithing bench without the need of Schematics, the user can replicate that item just by having the materials in the crafting grid. Has a button on the right to auto craft desired items in each 5 seconds."
		""
		"---Refining tab: Brewing any potions like brewing stand but all at once in 5 seconds. If a Hipokute Grass is placed into a slot with any bottle, it \"brews\" into a High Potion. If a Hipokute Flower is placed into a slot with any bottle, it brews into a Full Potion. If a Magic Ore is placed into a slot, \"brews\" into 2 Pure Magisteel Nuggets."
	]
	quest.239014E4F1A3937C.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.239014E4F1A3937C.title: "&f&lGreat Sage"
	quest.23ABAA8DF41BBFF2.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, In-slot] Castle Guard:"
		"While this mode is in slot, the user is rendered immune to all forms of skills, magic and battlewills. The user cannot use skills, magic or battlewills while this mode is active. The user suffers the same penalty, as they cannot use any skills, magic or battlewills; however, they can attack and use Haki. This mode can only be active for a minute. The user needs at least 3 subordinates to make Castle Guard work."
		"(Castle guard can be bypassed by Nova Break)"
		""
		"[Active, Held] Angel Knight:"
		"The user presses and holds this ability for 30 seconds (10 when mastered) to summon an Angel Knight (3 when mastered). This Angel Knight is a subordinate who can help them."
		"(The Angel Knight has 50 HP (200 when mastered).) They have access to Holy Attack Resistance, Sleep Mist, and Solar Rain.)"
		""
		"[Active, Held] King's Authority:"
		"The user holds this ability for 60 seconds. (30 when mastered) to make a target a temporary subordinate. If the target's naming is on, this allows the user to name the subordinate without paying the MP cost. The user does, however, need to pay the EP of the target to subordinate them."
		"(King's authority needs 30% EP or more to work)"
	]
	quest.23ABAA8DF41BBFF2.title: "&f&lDominator"
	quest.24C1285929D927B7.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive - Toggle] - Precognition: 25% (50% with Mastery) Chance to auto-dodge a physical/projectile attack. Attacks that land will be reduced to 70% damage (50% with Mastery). Gain 33% (50% with Mastery) Crit chance on attack."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Press] - Future Sight: When activated, grants the player perfect dodge, perfect dodge negation and perfect crit chance for 10 seconds (20s with Mastery). After the duration, it cannot be used again for another 10 seconds. [Activate again to turn off the effect]."
	]
	quest.24C1285929D927B7.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.24C1285929D927B7.title: "&f&lSeer"
