	quest.27FD5E9119FDFE6C.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, Toggle] Force: Cannot be turned on unless Object is turned off. User is unaffected by (disintegration, slowness, slow falling, mining fatigue, burden) and shatter multilayer barrier. Entities are damaged when landing physical attacks on the user. Does not stop user from being damaged."
		""
		"[Active, Toggle] Object: Cannot be turned on unless Force is turned off. User takes greatly reduced (50%) damage. Physical attack resistance acts like a nullification. User can be knocked out of this if an attack that degrades physical resistance or nullification hits them. Does not boost attack damage."
	]
	quest.27FD5E9119FDFE6C.title: "&f&lStripes"
	quest.28622D10FCB2A252.quest_desc: [
		"&6&lOnce mastered, the user automatically gains Godly Craftsman"
		""
		"&0&l[Active]"
		""
		"Opens a GUI with access to a Spatial Storage. Stackable items in here stack to 128."
		""
		"Has a slot that instantly smelts entire stacks of objects."
		""
		"Has a built in crafting table and a custom enchanting table allowing the player to freely add whatever they wish from the list of analyzed enchantments."
		""
		"Enchanted books have their effects stored to be selected in the enchantment menu."
		""
		"Maximum bonus level is 1"
		""
		"---Gain Mastery by Enchanting or Learning Enchants (Should take 800 enchants/enchanted items to master, without skills that increase mastery gained)"
	]
	quest.28622D10FCB2A252.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.28622D10FCB2A252.title: "&f&lResearcher"
	quest.28FC7690F586F009.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive - Toggle] Makes the player able to see through illusions and invisible targets"
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Press] Presence Concealment: When activated, makes mobs unable to register the player for 120 seconds. Costs 200 MP."
		""
		"[Active - Press] Illusion: When activated, open a GUI that enables the player to choose any fake item to wear on each armor and hand slot."
		""
		"[Active - Hold] Fake Death : When held down, reduce the speed by 40% (20% with Mastery). While this mode is held down (maximum hold time is 30 seconds), if the user takes any type of damage, spawn a new body then instant kill it with the same type of damage and send a fake death message to every player online. At the same time, reduce the incoming damage by half for the user and put the user into Presence Concealment, and stay in concealment till release or max hold time is reached - 10s cooldown (5s with Mastery)"
	]
	quest.28FC7690F586F009.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.28FC7690F586F009.title: "&f&lFalsifier"
	quest.28FEA148AC4A8391.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive - Toggle] - Homing Projectile: Item thrown by user will be homing toward where the user’s looking at or lock on into a target and chase them (max range 50-blocks)."
		""
		"[Passive - True] - User deals much more damage using Kunai, Spear and Trident instead of their default damage."
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Press] - Throw: When activated, consumes the currently held item and creates a projectile with its texture as a model."
		"--The projectile deals 50 (100 if mastery, damage boosted with Gravity Domination/Manipulation toggled by x3/x2) damage,"
		"i"
		"--f the item is a weapon, then it deals its normal damage too."
		""
		"--If the thrown item is a block breaking tool, it will break blocks based on the broken block and tool level(Max breakable blocks in a row is 10,configurable)."
		""
		"--Items with elemental cores will deal elemental damage as well(Not boosted by manipulations or dominations)."
		""
		"--If used with an empty hand, creates an air projectile that deals 30 damage (50 with mastery)."
		""
		"--If activated while looking at an enemy within 2 blocks of the player, flings them 15 blocks instead (further with Gravity Manipulation/Domination toggled)."
		""
		"--Thrown item's momentum is boosted by the players momentum. Costs 40 MP each usage."
		""
		"&0&lMastery"
		"Thrown items (not arrows, tridents, kunais, ...) have Loyalty effect"
		"---If the player has Gravity Manipulation/Domination there is a higher return speed"
	]
