	quest.298C109288C19E7D.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive, In Slot] Assault Mode: When this skill is mastered, the first time the user would die, their death is prevented and user enters Assault Mode. This has a 1200 Second Cooldown, Assault Mode is active for 400 seconds (Both configurable)"
		""
		"[Passive, True] Hellblaze: When mastered, gain Black Flame."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, Held] Full Counter: This mode functions just like Reflector, however just for Projectiles, any projectile reflected, is automatically sent back towards the original caster, with tracking logic. The skill is reflected at x2 the power. (4x when mastered). Both configurable"
		""
		"[Active, In Slot] Dark Prominence: While in slot, attacks deal bonus Dark Damage on hit. (10%, 20% when mastered)"
		""
		"[Active, Held] Divine slayer: While held, begin charging a power scale up to 10, when released, the entity you're looking at is hit by the a number of attacks from the player, up to 10 + 1 (X + 5 when mastered), Scales off of attack damage."
	]
	quest.298C109288C19E7D.title: "&f&lCoffin of Darkness"
	quest.29FD24E73CFCE2E7.quest_subtitle: "5 min cooldown"
	quest.2A8A47A1CC11D777.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active] - Drain: When used while not looking at a mob, adds an effect to the users attacks that drains 200 (200 + 0.1% with Mastery) MP and AP (each) and gives it to the user (temporary, not max) for 10 seconds. When used while looking at a mob, it drains 200 (200 + 0.5% with mastery) MP and AP (each) and gives it to the user. Costs 100 MP."
		""
		"[Active] - Invigorate: When used while not looking at a mob or when sneaking, fully heals the player and removes all status effects. When looking at a mob while sneaking, fully heals them and removes all status effects [Cost 80 MP (40 with Mastery) per HP and 100 MP per effect level]. If used on a mob that can breed while its at full hp, will cause them to enter hearts mode."
		""
		"[Active] - Embracing Drain (Requires Learning): Requires the player to be looking at a mob and be within 2 blocks. Locks the player and the mob in place and drains 200 (0.5% with Mastery) MP and AP per second. Lasts for a total of 5 seconds. Causes pain effects even with resistance/nullification. Cost 500 MP."
		""
		"[Active - Held] Death Blessing (Requires Mastery + Learning): When holding down, a pair of divine hands reaching from the sky toward the position/target that the user is looking at (in 10 block range), while being casted, every entities in 6x6 block radius around the targeted position are slowed down by 60%. Once reaching 5s casted, all of the affected entities are instantly killed if their EP is lower than 50% of the player's and restores the player's expended MP and AP by the target mobs EP (75/25). If the target is between 50% and 75% Drains 25% EP and deals half their HP in damage. If above 75% drains 5% and deals half their HP in damage. Cost 7500 MP - 5s cooldown."
	]
	quest.2A8A47A1CC11D777.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.2A8A47A1CC11D777.title: "&f&lLust"
