	quest.2AED82EC16C68990.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive, Toggle] Repeating Action:"
		"Any physical damage you perform will be repeated a second time."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, Press] Recursion Depth:"
		"When activated, millions and billions of the user from other realities come together for 5 seconds."
		""
		"Every successive hit in a row decreases the user’s next hit’s damage by 10%, but the target will accumulate damage over the next 5 seconds. After the timer is up, all the damage you have dealt is added up and multiplied by 1.5x."
		""
		"Example: Activate > 50 > 45 > 40.5 > 36.45 > 32.805 > Skill mode ends. (50 + 45 + 40.5 + 36.45 + 32.805) x 1.5 = 204.755 x 1.5 = 307.1325. Total Damage: 514.8875"
		""
		"[Active, Press] Flarefrost Storehouse:"
		"The essence of a painful, burning memory has been unlocked. An empty storage sits before you, awaiting power from a strange, two pronged blade. The essence of a biting embraceful memory has been unlocked. An empty storage sits before you, awaiting power from a strange, long blade."
		""
		"Press to instantly move the held Memory Blades into your mainhand and offhand, Axiom-first. Crouch and press to manually manipulate the storage."
	]
