		"[Passive - Toggle] Engorge: When toggled on, increases the player's size by 1.5 times and grants various passive buffs (0.4 Knockback Resist, Knockback 1, 10 Bonus Damage, 2X Speed, 10 Armour). Makes the players hunger permanently fully saturated."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
