	quest.2E69FB9A4BC2DECE.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive - In Slot] - The player's attacks have a 50% chance to seize 1% of the enemies MP, which restores the player's expended MP."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Press] - Rob: Only works on opponents with an EP higher than the user. Steals 1 of their skills (Only Common and Extra skills) or Aspectual Magics. 25% chance at success, which raises to 50% with Mastery. Costs 1,000 MP each attempt - 10s cooldown."
		""
		"[Active - Press] - Copy: Copies 1 of their skills (Only Common, Extra, and Intrinsic skills) or Aspectual Magics of a target. 25% chance at success, which raises to 50% with Mastery. Costs 1,000 MP each attempt - 10s cooldown."
		""
		"[Active - Press] - Force Takeover (Requires Mastery): Works like Rob, but works on targets weaker than the user and has a 100% success rate. When used on a summon owned by someone with 75% the user's EP or lower, steal that summon. Costs 5,000 MP - 10s cooldown."
