	quest.2E7758D1ABA6AC32.quest_desc: ["Ultimine is a useful early game mod that lets you mine specific patterns (tunnels, stright lines, etc) or same material. By default it should be button 4 on your mouse but can be configured in settings. To change the mode use crouch + ultime button and the scroll wheel. "]
