	quest.2E7C2E2B9DDA73D4.quest_desc: [
		"Reset Counters are gated by Reincarnation Essence on top of other requirments, which functions as a threshold resource. Once your essence meets the required amount and you meet the other req, you can trigger a Reset Counter to initiate the reincarnation process, which clears your current essence and increases the requirements for the next cycle."
		""
		"The Skill Progression System:"
		"The Reset Counter serves as the primary mechanism for expanding your abilities:"
		""
		"Unique Skill Acquisition: Each time you successfully trigger a Reset Counter, you have the opportunity to gain +1 unique skill."
		""
		"Configuration Settings:"
		""
		"If set to 1: You will be granted an additional Unique Skill every single time you perform a successful Reset Counter, provided you have met the required Reincarnation Essence threshold."
		""
		"If set to 3: The system requires more mastery; you must perform a successful Reset Counter 3 times to earn the bonus of an extra Unique Skill."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"Soul Level Requirement: Skills are \"locked\" behind the strength of your soul. To unlock more skill slots or higher-tier skills, you must increase your Soul Level (often linked to your EP or total number of successful Reset Counters)."
		""
		"The Lock Mechanism: If you acquire a skill that exceeds your current \"Soul Capacity,\" the skill will appear in your menu but remain Locked/Inactive until you reach the necessary threshold."
	]
	quest.2E7C2E2B9DDA73D4.quest_subtitle: "&fReset Counter/Skill locks"
	quest.2E7C2E2B9DDA73D4.title: "&f&lEnd Game"
