	quest.3AF620FBF39958AA.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Requires Mastery, Passive, Toggled] On Mastery, prevents Cook and Severance from being applied to the player."
		""
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, Hold] Constant: Health - Holding down the skill key will preserve your current health and spiritual health no matter how much damage you take. This mode drains 1000 magicules every second of is held down. When releasing, you will have a cooldown of 10 seconds,"
		"After 15 seconds of holding this ability down, this mode automatically turns off with a longer cooldown of 15 seconds."
		""
		"[Active, Press] Constant: Physical - After pressing the skill key, begin a 5 second timer. It will record the highest physical hit you perform during this timer. After the timer has ended, [Constant: Destruction] becomes available to use. Puts the skill on a 10 second cooldown after the key is pressed."
		""
		"[Active, Held, Locked] Constant: Destruction - On the completion of Constant: Physical, become able to use Constant: Destruction. While holding down this skill mode, your damage will stagnate and always deal the highest hit you saved in Constant: Physical. This mode drains 3000 magicules every second it is held down. When releasing, you will have a cooldown of 10 seconds,"
		"After 15 seconds of holding this ability down, this mode automatically turns off with a longer cooldown of 15 seconds."
		""
		"[Requires Mastery, Active, Press] Constant: Energy - For 10 seconds after pressing this mode, your Magicules and Aura will not deplete. However, it will begin a hidden counter. After the 10 seconds are up, the cost of all the abilities that you used will be added up and multiplied by two, then subtracted from each of your statistics accordingly. If the drain from this mode would exceed 0%, instead set your magicules to 25% and prevent regeneration of magicules for 3 minutes."
	]
	quest.3AF620FBF39958AA.title: "&f&lConstant"
	quest.3B8B2253F0A077A7.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Press] When used while not looking at a target, remove all negative status effects from the user and restore their hp to full including Severance damage. When looking at a mob, remove all their negative status effects and restores their hp to full. Costs 60 MP (40 with Mastery) each healed HP and 100 MP each effect level removed."
	]
	quest.3B8B2253F0A077A7.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.3B8B2253F0A077A7.title: "&f&lChef"
	quest.3C06849D565EFF80.quest_desc: [
		"&f"
		"Build your standing with the Dwarves to unlock better trade deals. Your actions determine your DR, which directly impacts your buying power."
		""
		"&2&lGaining Reputation:"
		""
		"+1.0 DR: Save a Dwarf by defeating a monster attacking them."
		""
		"+0.1 DR: Level up a Dwarf Merchant’s trade tier."
		""
		"+0.05 DR: Every purchase transaction."
		""
		"+0.01 DR: Every sales transaction."
		""
		"&4&lLosing Reputation:"
		""
		"-0.1 DR: Attacking a Dwarf while another is nearby (witnessed)."
		""
		"-1.0 DR: Killing a Dwarf while another is nearby (witnessed)."
		""
		"The Impact:"
		""
		"Positive DR: Enjoy a 0.5% discount per point."
		""
		"Negative DR: Suffer a 2% price penalty per point."
	]
	quest.3C06849D565EFF80.quest_subtitle: "&5The Magical Villager"
	quest.3C06849D565EFF80.title: "&f&l Find The Little People"
	quest.3C23D96F0D0CC052.quest_desc: ["&f&lPlacing 8 low quality magic crystals on the pedestals, then placing a low magisteel nugget in the center will transmute a medium quality magic crystal at the cost of 500 source"]
	quest.3C47884B35EA4509.quest_subtitle: "Ewwww feels like jizz"
	quest.3C47884B35EA4509.title: "Lower Life Form"
	quest.3C6DC2A1106CABBB.title: "&f&lObtain A Medium Spirit Of Light"
	quest.3CBCE51C60F2174B.quest_subtitle: "5 min cooldown"
	quest.3CC48F5B2658D2EA.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassives"
		"Passive (True) - Shadow Legion"
		""
		"Enemies defeated personally by the Sovereign have a chance to leave behind a Lingering Shadow."
		""
		"A defeated creature only qualifies if:"
		""
		"It is not a player."
		"It is not already a Sovereign Shadow."
		"It was hostile or actively targeting the Sovereign."
		"The Sovereign possesses at least twice the target’s original EP."
		""
		"The chance of producing a Lingering Shadow is:"
		""
		"Normal: 1/20"
		"Mastered: 1/15"
		""
		"Lingering Shadows remain for 20 seconds and must be extracted with Arise before disappearing."
		""
		"Passive (True) - Shadow Ranks"
		""
		"Each Shadow is assigned a rank based on its original EP compared with the Sovereign's EP when it is extracted."
		""
		"Soldier - Up to 10% of Sovereign EP - 1 Storage Slot - 30-second recovery"
		""
		"Knight - Above 10%, up to 20% - 3 Storage Slots - 1-minute recovery"
		""
		"Commander - Above 20%, up to 35% - 6 Storage Slots - 2-minute recovery"
		""
		"General - Above 35%, up to 50% - 12 Storage Slots - 5-minute recovery"
		""
		"Additional rank rules:"
		""
		"A Shadow with at least 200,000 original EP is always Commander rank or higher."
		"A Shadow with at least 500,000 original EP is always General rank."
		"A defeated Shadow is never permanently lost. It returns to Shadow Storage after completing its rank-based recovery time."
		""
		"Passive (True) - First Subjugation"
		""
		"The first successful extraction of each unique entity type grants the user EP equal to 50% of that target's original EP."
		""
		"This reward can only be earned once per entity type. Permanently releasing the Shadow does not reset the reward. "
		"Passive (True) - Sovereign's Growth"
		""
		"A Shadow's strength increases as the Sovereign's current EP grows compared with the Shadow's original EP."
		""
		"At 2x the Shadow's EP"
		"Normal: 70% power"
		"Mastered: 80% power"
		""
		"At 3x the Shadow's EP"
		"Normal: 85% power"
		"Mastered: 95% power"
		""
		"At 5x the Shadow's EP"
		"Normal: 100% power"
		"Mastered: 110% power"
		""
		"At 8x or more"
		"Normal: 110% power"
		"Mastered: 125% power"
		""
		"Growth scales the Shadow's physical and spiritual combat stats. Once extracted, a Shadow never falls below the first Growth tier, even if the Sovereign later loses EP."
		""
		"Passive (True) - Shadow-Infused Attacks"
		""
		"Every successful Shadow attack deals additional Spiritual Damage."
		""
		"Normal: 25%"
		"Mastered: 35%"
		""
		"Passive (True) - Sovereign's Claim"
		""
		"Kills made by a Shadow grant the normal Tensura EP reward to its Sovereign."
		""
		"Passive (True) - Shadow Upkeep"
		""
		"Stored and recovering Shadows cost no Magicules. Deployed Shadows continuously consume Magicules based on their original EP and the Sovereign's current EP."
		""
		"MP per second = Shadow Original EP x [0.0005 + 0.003 x (Shadow EP / Sovereign EP)]"
		""
		"Stronger Shadows cost more to maintain, while the same Shadow becomes cheaper as the player grows."
		""
		"Exchange Anchors consume only 10% of their normal upkeep. Sovereign's Domain reduces all deployed Shadow and Exchange Anchor upkeep by 50%."
		""
		"If the Sovereign cannot afford the next upkeep payment, the entire active legion retreats and Auto Summon is disabled."
		""
		"Passive (Toggle, Requires Mastery) - Monarch's Presence"
		""
		"Toggling the skill activates Monarch's Presence."
		""
		"Mobs within 12 blocks are affected if their EP is below 5% of the Sovereign's current EP."
		""
		"Affected mobs receive for 6 seconds:"
		""
		"True Fear"
		"Weakness II"
		"Slowness II"
		"get un-agro"
		""
		"After the effects end, that mob becomes immune to Monarch's Presence for 15 seconds."
		""
		"&0&lActives"
		"Active (Press) - Arise"
		""
		"Attempts to extract the nearest Lingering Shadow"
		""
		"Arise has a 2-second cooldown. Each Lingering Shadow allows three failed extraction attempts. After the third failure, the soul is destroyed."
		""
		"Target at 10% or less of Sovereign EP"
		"Normal Success Rate: 50%"
		"Mastered Success Rate: 65%"
		""
		"Target above 10%, up to 25%"
		"Normal Success Rate: 15%"
		"Mastered Success Rate: 25%"
		""
		"Target above 25%, up to 50%"
		"Normal Success Rate: 1%"
		"Mastered Success Rate: 3%"
		""
		"Active (Press) - Shadow Storage"
		""
		"Opens the Shadow Storage UI. It displays each Shadow's name, entity type, rank, original EP, Growth percentage, Storage Slot cost, upkeep, and current status."
		""
		"Available controls:"
		""
		"Summon or retreat individual Shadows."
		"Permanently release a Shadow."
		"Enable or disable Auto Summon."
		"Retreat All Shadows."
		""
		"Auto Summon deploys every available Shadow and redeploys recovering Shadows when ready. Retreat All forcibly disables Auto Summon."
		""
		"Shadow Storage Capacity:"
		"Below 25,000 EP: 10 Slots"
		"25,000 EP: 14 Slots"
		"75,000 EP: 18 Slots"
		"150,000 EP: 22 Slots"
		"300,000 EP: 27 Slots"
		"600,000 EP: 32 Slots"
		"1,200,000 EP: 37 Slots"
		"2,500,000 EP: 42 Slots"
		"5,000,000 EP: 46 Slots"
		"10,000,000 EP: 50 Slots"
		""
		"Mastery grants 20 additional Storage Slots."
		""
		"Active (Press and Shift Press) - Shadow Exchange"
		""
		"Shift press places the weakest available stored Shadow as an Exchange Anchor."
		""
		"Requirements:"
		"Requires 10 seconds out of combat"
		"Costs 20% of max Magicules"
		"Allows 3 anchors (5 after Mastery)"
		"Auto lowest EP Shadow"
		"Anchors don't move and don't attack"
		"Anchors can be killed"
		"A dead enters normal Shadow recovery"
		"Anchors can be placed and accessed across dimensions"
		""
		"Regular press opens the Shadow Exchange ui and begins a 10 sec prep period. If you take damage during the prep period the ui cancels and you have to open it again."
		""
		"Active (Press, Requires Mastery) - Sovereign's Domain"
		""
		"Unleashes the full authority of the Shadow Monarch for 90 seconds."
		""
		"While active:"
		"User damage is 2x"
		"Shadow damage is 1.5x"
		"Shadow and Exchange Anchor upkeep is reduced by 50%."
		"The 6-minute cooldown begins after the 90-second duration ends."
	]
	quest.3CC48F5B2658D2EA.title: "&f&lSovereign"
	quest.3CD72E5BBA7CAF84.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive] Certain Outcome: When **toggled**, all attacks made by the player become critical hits automatically. When **in-slot**, attacks made by the player shatter all barrier points unless the target has Law Manipulation or an Ultimate Skill and has an EP more than 2X the player's."
		""
		"[Passive - Toggle] Optimal Action: The player's attacks ignore all forms of dodge. Learning and Mastering abilities grants 5 points instead of 1. Nullification is treated as resistance and resistance is bypassed."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - toggle] Chaotic Fate (Requires Learning): When activated, makes the damage of the player's next attack reduce the target's max hp by the amount of damage dealt. Crouching and using chaotic fate will undo all permanent damage done with chaotic fate to the user, looking at a mob will do it to them. When activated with mastery, it will turn into a active - press ability"
	]
	quest.3CD72E5BBA7CAF84.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.3CD72E5BBA7CAF84.title: "&f&lCook"
	quest.3D929CA2F60BD455.quest_desc: ["A teleportation spell that leaves a trail of freezing frost behind. It perfectly combines top-tier mobility with immediate kiting capabilities."]
	quest.3DC88DA099EBD926.quest_desc: ["You can eventually make an unbreakable version of this!"]
	quest.3DC88DA099EBD926.quest_subtitle: "Useful tool for builders!"
	quest.3E0A601D325FFEE8.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Press] Crafting: Opens a crafting GUI that also has an option to Decraft items into their base components. Second tab is a combination of anvil (without renaming) and grindstone (be able to select what enchantments to remove). Using the anvil function to combine enchantments allows it to bypass the vanilla cap of obtainable levels of an enchant By a max of 2 Levels above Vanilla Max."
		""
		"[Active - Press] Synthesize: When used, if the user is looking at a Charybdis Core, gain skills and EP based on the Core’s state. If the player is looking at a mob tagged Spiritual that is at 25% hp or lower, the mob perishes and the player gains all the skills and EP of the mob, only works once per mob type. (Cannot be a summoned spirit, has to be found in the wild)"
		""
		"[Active - Press] Separate: When used on mobs with an EP below 75% of the player, steal one skill of type Common / Extra. When used on oxidized copper, strip it. When used on ore blocks, it gives the player the ore and leaves a stone/deepslate block in its place. When used on suspicious sand/gravel instantly separate item. When used while not looking at anything, remove status effects (unless it’s a beneficial skill effect) from the user. When used while sneaking and looking at subordinate/ally, remove status effects from them instead including severance [Costs 100 MP each effect level removed]."
	]
	quest.3E0A601D325FFEE8.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.3E0A601D325FFEE8.title: "&f&lDegenerate"
	quest.3E2C61959A603AD2.quest_desc: [
		"&5&lLaw Manipulation is acquired upon mastering the skill."
		""
		"&0&lPassive"
		"When toggled, increases the amount of Learned Points and Mastery Points gained by 2"
		""
		"Thought Acceleration (Like Normal)"
		"Chant Annulment (Like Normal)"
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[ Active - Press] - Analytical Appraisal: Analysis Level 18 (28 with mastery), distance 40 blocks (50 with Mastery)"
		""
		"[ Active - Press] - Analyze: When held down for 5s (3s with mastery) (affected by Chanting Speed) while looking at a Magic Circle or Magic Entity (barrier, field, projectile, etc.) within 30 blocks radius, copies the magic. It can't copy any spirit magic or elemental summoning magic"
	]
	quest.3E2C61959A603AD2.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.3E2C61959A603AD2.title: "&f&lAnalyst"
	quest.3E708127FFBEDAF6.quest_desc: ["Nice job completing the first part of your adventure. The Next part is where things amp up!"]
	quest.3E708127FFBEDAF6.quest_subtitle: "Chapter One Done!"
	quest.3E747DA6C8915BAD.quest_subtitle: "Only B rank and above can purchase this"
	quest.3E8BA9B08E5BBDAC.title: "&f&lHere You Earned it"
	quest.3F11F501F2539FCB.quest_desc: [
		"&5&lAll activations are accompanied by a screech sound effect - Doesn’t work on Spiritual Lifeforms or those under the effects of Rampage."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Press] Target: Turns the looked at mob into an ally for 10 Minutes. Costs 50 MP, negated by Spiritual Attack Nullification. Reduced to 5 Minutes by Resistance."
		""
		"[Active - Press] Area: Turns all mobs within a 20x20 (30x30 with Mastery) radius into allies for 5 Minutes. Costs 80 MP per mob. Negated by Spiritual Attack Nullification. Reduced to 2.5 Minutes by Resistance."
		""
		"[Active - Press] Charm: Applies a \"Hero of the Village V\" effect for 2 Minutes to the player. Costs 200 MP."
		""
		"[Active - Press] Kill: Kills all mobs (that is under mind control) within a 20x20 (30x30 with Mastery) Radius. Costs 100 MP per mob. Negated by Spiritual Attack Nullification. Deals half hp in damage with resistance. - Cooldown: 5s (3s with mastery)"
	]
	quest.3F11F501F2539FCB.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.3F11F501F2539FCB.title: "&f&lBewilder"
	quest.3F6B0025F0DED584.quest_desc: [
		"Go to the Spirt Tree and get someone else to hit you with Electro Blast"
		""
		"If you are playing alone you can get it from getting hit by Sylphide (Greater Wind Elemental) or using the Ice and Fire mod to get hit by the breath of a Lighting Dragon though you should have a way to get Fragility Effect as normally they don't do enough damage, can make fragility potions or use the Shrink Spell."
		""
		"When toggled, prevents Lightning damage if it falls below 50% of your Max HP. If the attack is not below 50% of your Max HP the damage will be halved."
	]
	quest.3F6B0025F0DED584.quest_subtitle: "&f&lTips"
	quest.3F6B0025F0DED584.title: "&#3A33AB&lElectricity Resistance"
	quest.3F7F02DFB2A164ED.quest_desc: ["Killing creatures near this soucelink will produce source"]
	quest.3F8373BF8354C6B7.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive, Toggled] Thought Acceleration"
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, Press] Pursuit of Tutelage (Requires Mastery)"
		"When used, the user can open up a Skill Creation Menu and teach their known Spells and Battlewills to someone."
		""
		"[Active, In-slot]Pursuit of Truth"
		"&l-While In-Slot the user gains the following benefits."
		"--The user's Mastery and Learn Speed are increased by +10"
		"--The user's Melee Dodge Chance is at 50%, the user's Projectile Dodge Chance is at 25% and the user's Critical Hit Chance is at 30%, while it as a 40% Dodge Negation."
		"&l-When shift pressed, it will cycle between Pursuit Modes."
		"--Pursuit of Surprise: This highlights nearby traps. Lava, Pointed Dripstone, Tripwire, Sculk Sensor, Sculk Shrieker, Cobweb, Powder Snow, Trapped Chest, TNT, TNT Minecart, End Crystal [ Add a config to add other blocks in ]"
		"--Pursuit of Treasure: Chest, Barrel, Vault, Dragon Egg, Ancient Debris and Magic Ore, Charybdis Core. [ Add a config to add other blocks in ]"
		"--Pursuit of Battle: Highlights nearby mobs in colors, yellow for neutral, red for hostile"
		""
		"[Active, Toggle] Analytical Appraisal:"
		"The Appraisal Level is 5, 15 on mastery."
	]
	quest.3F8373BF8354C6B7.title: "&f&lInvestigator"
	quest.3F8561B5BDFB440E.quest_subtitle: "Only E rank and above can purchase this"
	quest.3F96EFDDB89B18A0.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive - Toggle] - Phantasmal Strike (Requires Learning): When activated, applies an effect to the player's attacks that deals 10 (+1% of target’s max SHP with Mastery) Spiritual damage."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Hold] - Deep Hypno: While looking at a mob, adds one level of Drowsiness every 10 seconds (15 with spiritual resistance, 20 with nullification) and 5 (10 with Mastered) seconds of duration. Each level of sleep reduces movement speed by 25% and has an additional effect identical to weakness and fragility. On lvl 5, it kills the target instantly. When used on a magic circle, will destroy the magic circle and place it on a 3 second cooldown (5 seconds with mastery)."
		""
		"[Active - Hold] - Fallen Hypno: Deep Hypno but within an Aoe radius of 10x10 (20x20 if mastered) and has double the casting time - 20 seconds (25 with spiritual resistance, 30 with nullification)."
		""
		"[Active - Hold] - Deprive: Drains 1000 MP (+0.3% target’s max MP with Mastery) and deals 10 (+1% of target’s max SHP with Mastery) Spiritual Damage every second while looking at a mob within 5 (15 with Mastery) blocks. If used on a mob with spiritual HP below 50%, they become tamed/subordinate to the player."
		""
		"[Active - Hold] - Rest: While held down, makes the player unable to move, attack, or activate other abilities. Regen 10 (+1% of target’s max with Mastery) HP and Spiritual HP per sec and increases the players MP, and AP Regen by 10X. If MP is at max, it fills up a temporary MP storage at the same rate. If there is enough MP in the temporary storage (1000 x Y = X [Y = Number of Allies. X = Cost]), right clicking will restore 1000 MP, 1000 AP, 50 HP and 10 Spiritual HP to all allies within a 30x30 radius."
		""
		"[Active - Press] - Fallen Strike (Requires Phantasmal Style. Requires Mastery.): At the cost of 5,000MP, deals 500 Spiritual Damage to the looked at target. Ignores Spiritual Attack Resistance and Nullification. [Cooldown 10s]"
	]
	quest.3F96EFDDB89B18A0.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.3F96EFDDB89B18A0.title: "&f&lSloth"
	quest.3FD33658DD08FF7A.quest_desc: [
		"&f&lLocation: Resides at the Altar of Fire within the Ruined Citadel in the Nether."
		""
		"Quest Description: A knight of pure solar fire guards the heart of the Nether. Place Burning Ashes on the altar to summon him. He wields massive fire shockwaves and, in his second phase, his flames turn to a deathly \"icy cold\"."
	]
	quest.3FD33658DD08FF7A.quest_subtitle: "&0&lThe Eternal Ember"
	quest.3FD33658DD08FF7A.title: "&4&lIgnis"
	quest.4014018705D764A3.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Hold] Predation : On use, creates a black mist (breath) up to a 10 block (shifting and using the ability will change the block consumption between only blocks, liquids or both, slideable range with scroll mouse. Max 15 with mastery) radius in front of the player If it comes into contact with a mob, deals 50 damage, applies Corrosion for 5 seconds, and drains 1000 MP, with a 30% chance to gain 1-3 random Intrinsic, Common, Extra, or Resists skill/s from the target. If an enemy is killed by Predation, gains all of their Intrinsic, Common, Extra and Resists skills. With Mastery, if a Magic projectile is eaten, then the player gains that magic . For the first time killing a type of mob, targets killed have 80% of their ep added to the players max instead of the usual 3%. This can be toggled to consume blocks using shift + ability key while on the predation mode, which will automatically be added to Stomach."
		""
		"[Active - Press] Stomach : When activated, grants access to a spatial storage with the size of a chest with 9 rows. Items are able to be stacked to 666 instead of 64."
		""
		"[Active - Hold] Corrosion: Costs 200 MP and deals 10 Corrosion damage every 10 ticks to all enemies in a 10x10 radius. Enemies killed by this have their Resists, Intrinsic, Common, and Extra Skills taken by the player."
		""
		"[Active - Press] Receive : Intrinsic, Common, and Extra skills owned by the player's subordinates are given to the player."
		""
		"[Active - Press] Isolation : Consumes held item and restores mp similar to Absorb and Dissolve, but with twice the restored mp. If nothing is held and the player is looking at a target, remove all negative status effects from that target. If used while empty handed and not looking at a mob, removes all negative status effects from the player [Costs 100 MP each effect level removed]."
	]
	quest.4014018705D764A3.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.4014018705D764A3.title: "&f&lGluttony"
	quest.408E4F2F9BA8FDD1.quest_subtitle: "Be sure to get youself a spirit while your there"
	quest.408E4F2F9BA8FDD1.title: "DANG what a big tree"
	quest.40C3E37399E1B3E2.quest_desc: ["For the recipies that require source place this jar next to your transmutation area (where you have the pedistals and such set up). A full jar contains 10k source"]
	quest.40C3E37399E1B3E2.title: "&0&lImportant Info"
	quest.40C7F8E43865182A.quest_subtitle: "pretty usful to see the unseen"
	quest.40E537414168D837.quest_desc: ["Time to get that jar full of source. The next items will help you funnel that energy."]
	quest.40E537414168D837.title: "&f&lFill It Up"
	quest.4110800A2F766C8C.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive - Toggle] Silence Between Two Strikes - All player sounds are muted."
		""
		"[Passive - Toggle] Hidden Authority - Go invisible and conceal your presence to those around. On servers, hide yourself from the tab list as well and fake a leaving message. Untoggling will play a fake joining message."
		""
		"[Passive - True] Ruler's Reign - All nearby subordinates gain Inspiration 1. On mastery, this changes to Inspiration 2."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Press] Copy - Fetch the skill list of your target. Copy one random skill (Intrinsics, Commons or Extras) at random from the learned skills of your target. Copied skills are temporary and are lost on death. Copied skills last for as long as the user holds on to them or dies with it. You can only copy up to five temporary skills, where your cap will then be full. Shift + Skill Key to display all currently copied skills. 25% success rate. 75% failure rate. Changes to 50-50 on mastery."
		""
		"[Active - Press] Paste - Paste one of your five copied skills at random to your target. The target need not be a subordinate. The target will keep the skill until they die. Again, shift + skill key to display all currently copied skills in the list. 25% success rate. 75% failure rate. Changes to 50-50 on mastery. On failure, the copied skill is lost."
		""
		"[Active - Press] Recruitment - Recruit the target as a temporary subordinate (Charm) if they are weaker than you by 5x. Costs 1000 MP. Fails if the target is a boss."
	]
	quest.4110800A2F766C8C.title: "&f&lHidden Ruler"
	quest.411F0C94067E550F.quest_desc: [
		"The human race is one of the most flexable races, A clasic for sure! "
		""
		"Description: A weak but populous race that relies more on technology and numbers than brute force. Their low magicule count makes skills and magic users a rarity among them, instead favouring battlewill."
		""
		"Stats: "
		""
		"HP: 20"
	]
	quest.411F0C94067E550F.quest_subtitle: "You Are a True OtherWorlder"
	quest.411F0C94067E550F.title: "Human"
	quest.41D3685F650A24CE.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive - In Slot] Thought Acceleration - Increase magic casting speed multiplier by 2, increase movement speed by 0.01 (0.02 with Mastery), increase attack speed by 0.2 (0.4 with Mastery)"
		""
		"[Passive - In Slot] Unstable Transmitter - Falling below 10% health gives you 75% of your maximum health as absorption. Furthermore, at the time of being damaged below 10%, all enemies nearby will be teleported away. Puts the skill on a cooldown of 120 seconds."
		""
		"[Passive, In Slot] Void Infusion - Infuse your fists with the power of the void, dealing extra armor damage and passively severing the target for a small percentage of their health."
		""
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Press] Destroyer Haki - Emanate the aura of the Destroyer, heralding the end as you inflict nearby enemies with unavoidable, non-resistable Void damage at 25 per second (50 when mastered). Additionally, crush the souls of your enemies under the weight of their sins, reducing their movement speed based on how powerful you are above the opponent. Costs 500 MP per second to use."
		"--Bonus Info: Destroyer Haki is immune to cooldowns. Be careful when using in spawn areas or areas that limit ability use."
		""
		"[Active - Hold] Dimension Hopper - Switch the dimensions, allowing you to scroll to select the dimensions (Overworld, Nether, End, Hell,Spirit Dimension) and hop between them. On release, your dimension will change. Nothing will happen if you release and you are still in that dimension. Cooldown of 600 seconds. 300 when mastered."
	]
	quest.41D3685F650A24CE.title: "&f&lCrasher"
	quest.42222A220089F73B.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive, In Slot] Status Quo: The user's maximum Health cannot be reduced by the likes of Severance or Cook."
		""
		"[Passive, Toggled] Render Stillness: The user can walk over liquid blocks as if they were a solid."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, In Slot]Fixed State: The user's Magicules and Aura are not expended while in Fixed State."
		""
		"[Active, Held] Air Wall: The user produces a solid 5x5 air wall in front of them. This air wall destroys any projectiles that come in contact with it and cannot be walked through."
	]
	quest.42222A220089F73B.title: "&f&lStasis"
	quest.42DD405227F8366A.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive - True] - Destiny Change: If the player would die, instead restore them to full HP, remove negative status effects, and restore their MP and AP up to 50% (75% with Mastery) of their maximum total. This applies for EACH type of damage once a Minecraft day (20 minutes). Once this ability is triggered, the skill will start its 20 mins cooldown, the skill can still be used during the cooldown, when the 20 mins cooldown runs out, the user can again revive from the death type that they already endured during the last 20 mins."
		""
		"[Passive - In Slot] - Unexpected Result: (Becomes Toggleable with Mastery) If the player's HP is below 25%, grants a Strength 10 Buff, + 0.2 Attack Speed, + 0.04 Movement Speed, + 1 Swim Speed , and 15% physical attack auto-dodge chance. (double all buffs with Mastery)"
	]
