	quest.447DF570F7FD0237.quest_desc: [
		"Passive (True) - Pressure"
		""
		"Calamity stores 0–100 Pressure."
		""
		"Pressure is gained from:"
		""
		"Incoming attacks"
		"Harmful effect"
		"Falling below 75%, 50%, or 25% HP"
		"Three or more hostile mobs targeting the user within 12 blocks"
		"Remaining in combat for 10 seconds: +0.25/sec."
		""
		"After 10 seconds without combat contributions, Pressure decays by 1/sec. Pressure resets after death."
		""
		"Pressure Vessel Stages"
		""
		"0–24 - Dormant: No bonuses."
		""
		"25–49 - Agitation: +5% damage, movement speed, and attack speed."
		""
		"50–74 - Distortion: +15% damage, +10% movement and attack speed, +0.25 knockback resistance."
		""
		"75–99 - Overload: +30% damage, +15% movement and attack speed, +0.50 knockback resistance, +1 reach, and 15% damage reduction."
		""
		"100 - Critical Mass: +40% damage, +20% movement and attack speed, +0.75 knockback resistance, +1.5 reach, and 20% damage reduction."
		""
		"Critical Mass also caps current HP at 80% and reduces SHP, Magicule, and Aura regeneration by 50%."
		""
		"Stage damage applies to the user’s direct attacks and owned projectiles."
		""
		"Passive (True) - Critical Stress"
		""
		"Remaining at exactly 100 Pressure grants one Critical Stress level every 20 seconds."
		""
		"Each level grants +5% outgoing damage, up to 10 levels and +50% after 200 seconds. Dropping below 100 Pressure resets every level."
		""
		"While any level is active, outgoing hits cause recoil equal to 5% of the boosted damage, capped at 5% of Max HP. Recoil cannot reduce the user below 1 HP."
		""
		"Before Calamity is mastered, Critical Mass disables Ultraspeed Regeneration, Infinite Regeneration, and Deep Recovery."
		""
		"Suppression remains until Pressure falls below 95, after which previously active regeneration skills are restored when possible. Mastery removes only this suppression. "
		""
		"Passive (True) - Calamity Sacrifice"
		""
		"Once per life, otherwise-fatal damage at 100 Pressure is canceled unless it bypasses invulnerability."
		""
		"The user:"
		""
		"Returns at 60% Max HP."
		"Loses all Pressure and Critical Stress."
		"Gains two seconds of invulnerability."
		""
		"Calamity is sealed for 30 seconds"
		""
		"Passive (True) - Omen"
		""
		"While the user is below 30% Max HP, enemies that damage them build individual Omen stacks."
		""
		"The first stack is immediate. Additional stacks require 3 seconds each."
		""
		"Omen expires after 30 seconds without that enemy damaging the user, applying a harmful effect, or being damaged by the user. Existing stacks can still be refreshed after the user heals above 30%."
		""
		"Omen I"
		""
		"+5% Pressure generated from that enemy."
		"Enemy takes +4% damage from the user."
		""
		"Omen II"
		""
		"+10% Pressure generated."
		"Enemy takes +8% damage."
		""
		"Omen III - Condemned"
		""
		"+20% Pressure generated."
		"Enemy takes +12% damage."
		"Grants 4 base mastery when newly reached."
		""
		"Passive (True) - True Fear"
		""
		"When an enemy newly becomes Condemned, True Fear activates for 7 seconds if that enemy’s 60-second cooldown is ready."
		""
		"The affected enemy:"
		""
		"Cannot damage the Calamity user."
		"Cannot target or pursue them if it is a mob."
		"Loses 65% movement speed and cannot sprint."
		"Has Elytra, vanilla/Tensura flight, and Gravity Flight disabled."
		" "
		"Active (Hold and Release) - Calamitous Blow"
		""
		"Releases a forward cone that damages and knocks back enemies."
		""
		"The directly aimed target takes full damage. Other enemies in the cone take 40% shockwave damage."
		""
		"Damage:"
		""
		"Attack Damage × Charge Multiplier × EP Multiplier"
		""
		"Quick - Hold 0.25 seconds"
		""
		"5 Pressure"
		"1.25× damage"
		"5-block range"
		"0.75-second recovery"
		"+1 base mastery"
		""
		"Heavy - Hold 1 second"
		""
		"35 Pressure"
		"2× damage"
		"8-block range"
		"1-second recovery"
		"+3 base mastery"
		""
		"Maximum - Hold 2.5 seconds"
		""
		"60 Pressure"
		"3× damage"
		"12-block range"
		"1.5-second recovery"
		"+6 base mastery"
		""
		"Pressure is spent even if the attack misses. Mastery is granted only when at least one target is damaged."
		""
		"EP Multiplier"
		""
		"Below 10,000 EP: 1×"
		"10,000 EP: 1.05×"
		"100,000 EP: 1.10×"
		"500,000 EP: 1.20×"
		"1,000,000 EP: 1.30×"
		""
		"During Disaster Manifested, every tier becomes free and ignores its Pressure requirement"
		"Active (Toggle) - Disaster Manifested"
		""
		"Requires 80 Pressure or more. Press again to end the form."
		""
		"Cooldown: 300 seconds after the form ends"
		"Pressure Drain: 1/sec for the first 75 seconds, then 2/sec"
		""
		"Incoming damage is reduced by 25%."
		"Calamitous Blow deals 25% more damage."
		"Calamitous Blow reaches 50% farther and costs no Pressure."
		"Grants 1 base mastery every five seconds."
		""
		"Natural Pressure generation and decay are disabled. Condensed Pressure is the only intended way to restore Pressure during the form."
		""
		"The form ends when canceled, Pressure reaches 0, Calamity is sealed, or the user dies."
		""
		""
		"Active (Press, Requires Mastery) - Stressful Storage"
		""
		"Requires:"
		""
		"100 Pressure."
		"An available inventory slot."
		"Fewer than five owner-bound Condensed Pressure items."
		""
		"Consumes 100 Pressure to create one Condensed Pressure, which restores 50 Pressure when used."
		""
		"It can be consumed during Disaster Manifested, but not while sealed or already at 100 Pressure."
		""
		"Each condensed preasure is owner-bound"
		""
		"Mastery Sources"
		""
		"Quick, Heavy, or Maximum Blow: +1, +3, or +6"
		"Newly Condemning an enemy: +4"
		"Disaster Manifested: +1 every five seconds"
	]
