	quest.461A6B0C5B8D98D3.quest_desc: [
		"&5&l!!! You can NOT gain Skills from Players UNLESS the world is in Hardcore Mode (ONE LIFE) !!!"
		""
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive - True] - Unyield: Once a mob is named by the user, it will gain 1 (2 with Mastery) Unyielding Point each 5s that it’s 30 blocks around the player, this will decrease if the mob is too far away. If a subordinate dies to a damage source not from the owner, the user will gain 10% of the sub’s EP for each 120 points (10 minutes) it has - The maximum amount of EP can gain is 100% = 1200 points (100 minutes)."
		""
		"To gain the fallen Subordinates’ skills/magics/battlewills, the Subordinate needs to have at least 120 points for Skills, Battlewills, Magic, and 600 points for Unique Skills."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Press] - Backup: Upon activation, at the MP cost equal to 25% of the user’s max MP, spawn an immobile Body with all your EP and no skills at where the user is. When activated again, transfer the user’s soul to where the Body is and spawn a new Body where the user is, swap their Equipments in Armor and Hand slots (other slots are untouched) - Shift activate to remove the Backup Body. If the user dies when there’s a Backup available, automatically transfer them to that Backup (If KeepInventory is off, items in Armor and Hand slots of the user will spawn where they’re supposed to die, else those will spawn where the Backup is). Only works Multi-Dimensionally with Mastery."
	]
	quest.461A6B0C5B8D98D3.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.461A6B0C5B8D98D3.title: "&f&lUnyielding"
	quest.4648F694A3477BCE.title: "&f&lObtain A Medium Spirit Of Wind"
	quest.478D46F6CA78785E.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive, True] Spiritually One: The user obtains the Blessed Status."
		""
		"[Passive, Toggled] Elemental Boost: The user's Elemental Damage is boosted by 30%. 40% when mastered."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, Hold] Elemental Conversion: The user enters a meditative state where they cannot move, and converts any elemental damage taken to Magicules."
		""
		"[Active, Press] Elemental Connection: The user selects one of the elements to connect themselves too, they become immune to this element and boost the Elemental Damage by 20 Damage, 40 Damage when mastered."
	]
	quest.478D46F6CA78785E.title: "&f&lElementalist"
	quest.47F9B692915EFF6C.quest_subtitle: "&f&lPlace this nearby a souce link to be able to collect source"
	quest.4804443457AE2345.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive] Analytical Mirror - High-speed analysis of any reflected energy. The user instantly learns the"
		"\"logic\" behind an opponent's spell once it touches their shell. Gives 20% chance to learn an analyzed spell."
		""
		"[Passive] Energy Condensation - The user can store up to 2 times their own Magicule capacity by"
		"\"trapping\" absorbed spells in a state of total internal reflection. MP is gained over time from stored"
		"Magicules."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active] Full-Vector Reversal - Allows the user to reflect physical strikes by instantly reversing the kinetic"
		"energy vector back into the attacker. Reflects 50%(75% with mastery.) of the damage."
		""
		"[Active] Prismatic Fracture -"
		"Accumulates damage from attacks. When activated, Prismatic Fracture unleashes a counterattack by"
		"converting the accumulated damage into a barrage of projectiles, each dealing a portion of the stored"
		"damage to nearby enemies."
		""
		"[Active, Mastery] Soliton Flare - WIP "
	]
	quest.4804443457AE2345.title: "&f&lTotal Reflection"
	quest.4828D84CCE2B492D.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Press] - Fully heals the player and restores their MP and AP, gives them a Strength 10-equivalent damage increase, 20 armor points and +0.08 Speed, and temporarily increases their maximum MP and AP by 2x. Grants the player creative flight. It lasts for 3 Minutes and upon ending inflicts the player with Paralysis 2, Fragility 2, and Weakness 2 for 10 Minutes. 20 Minute Cooldown [1 Day]. Mastery increases the duration to 6 Minutes. 0 MP"
	]
	quest.4828D84CCE2B492D.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.4828D84CCE2B492D.title: "&f&lRoyal Beast"
	quest.482A24F6084C5B04.title: "&f&lObtain A Lesser Spirit Of Fire"
	quest.483BD5B440E57D73.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive, Toggle] Hindrance Removal - When activating this passive, instantly be cleared of any movement-hindering effects. This includes Burden and Slowness."
		""
		"While toggled, those effects cannot be applied to you."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, Press] Fixation - Using this skill mode will aim to target an entity 5 blocks ahead of you (10 blocks on mastery)."
		"--When missing, this mode goes on a 5 second cooldown."
		""
		"--If you successfully target an entity, Fixate that entity in place, making it impossible for them to move or attack. Your target cannot utilize skills while fixated. They also cannot turn their mouse. This lasts for 15 seconds. When the effect wears off, it cannot be re-applied for one minute."
		""
		"[Active, Press] Solidification - Solidify the air molecules in front of you, creating an invisible shield three blocks in front. You cannot walk through this shield, but it blocks all damage and projectiles from passing through it."
		"--Crouch and activate to remove it. Cooldown of 10 seconds."
		""
		"[Art, Press] Eternal Domain - At the user’s location, instantly create a Fixation field around you. When inside this field, gain the Stasis effect, setting all your magicule costs to ZERO while you are within the field. The field is 8 blocks big, doubling to 16 on mastery."
		"--Any targets caught WITHIN the radius of Eternal Domain are FIXATED while the domain exists."
		""
		"--Cooldown of 180 seconds. On mastery, this reduces to 90 seconds."
	]
