	quest.49A44FF2CE7EE6D0.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive - True] - When dying from Magicule Poisoning, the option to become a Majin appears 100% of the time."
		""
		"[Passive - Toggle] - Increases EP gained from defeating enemies from 3% to 6% (Split evenly between Aura and Magicule. 1.5% each). Grants 25% dodge negate. When mastered gain Haki Coat on tick."
		""
		"[Passive - In Slot] - Villain’s Intimidation : The player and their allies have a 50% critical hit rate and a 10% auto-dodge chance."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Press] - Villain’s Charisma (200 MP): When activated, all Passive and Neutral Mobs within a 20x20 radius will be treated as the player's allies and will assist them in combat for 120s [Negated by Spiritual Attack Nullification, reduced to 60s by Resistance]"
		""
		"[Active - Hold] - Demon Lord’s Haki: All mobs within a 30x30 radius are affected. If their EP is >= 75% of the user's used EP, it does nothing. Otherwise, gives 2 Fear levels for each 20% difference with the targets' EP. 50 MP per 20t."
	]
