	quest.4ED28CFB385739A4.quest_desc: [
		"B Key: Open Personal panel to check status or bind skills."
		""
		"R Key: Activate racial abilities (availability depends on selected race)."
		""
		"Z, X, C Keys: Release active skills."
		""
		"ALT + Skill Key: Switch between different skill modes."
		""
		"SHIFT + Skill Key: Access sub-modes for specific skills."
		""
		"V Key: Used to dodge or drop a mount."
		""
		"N Key: Biological naming (requires sufficient EP; only works on certain creatures)."
		""
		"Enter key:Opens backpack"
		""
		"f key: opens spell wheel"
		""
		"mouse button 5: cast selected spell"
		""
		"mouse button 4 toggles ultimine"
	]
	quest.4ED28CFB385739A4.quest_subtitle: "Important"
	quest.4ED28CFB385739A4.title: "Key Binds"
	quest.4EEEE067307B6E02.quest_subtitle: "Only S Class and above can exchange this"
	quest.4F96FA9285619A18.quest_desc: [
		"***If you want to be a hero you can NOT BE A Magjin (Some races are majin by default and cant become heros unless a unique ability makes you chaos sub race in which case you are both and can become a hero/ demon lord)***"
		""
		"&01- Spwan blessed (5% Chance on Reincarnation/Reset to be Blessed. This grants you all Elemental Spirits Plus Either Light or Dark when you pray, granting you the Hero Egg Instantly.)"
		""
		"&02- Acquire all 5 base element Greater Spirits (Fire, Water, Wind, Earth, Space) + a Greater Light or Greater Darkness spirit to Gain the Hero Egg"
		""
		"(1 or 2 Will get you hero egg)"
		""
		"To Hatch The Egg:"
		"you will need to regenerate HP while under 25% of your max HP while fighting a boss which meets all the requirements below."
		""
		"The boss must have at least 400k EP."
		"The boss must be below 50% HP."
		"The mob must be tagged as a valid boss for True Hero awakening. A list is provided below."
		"Bosses that count towards True Hero Awakening"
		""
		"Base Tensura"
		"Wither, Ender Dragon, Elemental Colossus, Charybdis, Akash, Ifrit, Sylphide, Undine, War Gnome, Orc Lord, Orc Disaster, Supermassive Slime, Fire Dragon, Ice Dragon, Lightning Dragon, Gorgon, Hydra, Dread Lich, Dead King"
		""
		"&2&lGains:"
		""
		"Grants a 3x Ep buff"
		"Evolution of all Resistances to Nullifications"
		"Grants Unpredictability. When toggled, while attacking or being attacked, ignores every Dodge, Crit Chance, and Dodge Avoidance abilities. Cannot be used without being a True Hero."
	]
	quest.4F96FA9285619A18.quest_subtitle: "&fGuide"
	quest.4F96FA9285619A18.title: "&6&lBecoming A Hero"
	quest.4FC5424B78D2BFD2.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"Passive, Toggle] Corrosive Touch - All your physical attacks now apply the corrosion effect. When unmastered, this effect is applied at Corrosion 2 for 10 seconds. On mastery, this upgrades to Corrosion 3 for 15 seconds. This is changeable in the config."
		"[Passive, In Slot] Corrosion Ward - Corrosion will NEVER apply to you."
		""
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, Held] Dissolve - Emit a dissolving aura around you, melting any targets nearby. This drains 100 MP/s, changeable in the config, and deals 10 Corrosive damage. It also additionally applies Corrosion 1 to all targets for 10 seconds."
		"On mastery, this upgrades to 15 Corrosion Damage, applying Corrosion 2 to all targets for 15 seconds,"
		"[Art (requires learning), Press] Cross Corrosion - Instantly coat your blade in corrosive acid. On your next attack, slash for heavy, armor-ignoring damage. This attack uses 1000.0 Magicules and is configurable in the config."
	]
	quest.4FC5424B78D2BFD2.title: "&f&lCorroder"
	quest.500F98ED04664D94.quest_subtitle: "The Tenseura Crafter"
	quest.500F98ED04664D94.title: "What a Table!"
	quest.507F9C9E27E225FC.quest_subtitle: "Kill it and take its stars"
	quest.507F9C9E27E225FC.title: "THE Dark Skeleton"
	quest.5099A249A80DB9D5.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain spiritual attack resistance you need to get hit by an attack that deals spiritual damage (damage that affects your SHP)."
		"The damage needs to be 15+"
		""
		"Go to the Spirit Tree and let someone attack you with a weapon that does spirit damage for example Dead End Rainbow, or they could use a weapon "
		"with the Soul Eater engraving."
		""
		"If you are playing alone then enjoy being jumped by Hinata, or drop a weapon with Soul Eater on the ground for a mob to pick up, and let them hit ya with it."
		""
		"Certain Darkness Magics, Darkness Cannon, Shadow Bind, and True Darkness, deal Spiritual Attack Damage too."
		""
		"Insanity also can deal Spiritual Damage, meaning if get high level of it, can be used to help get the Resistances."
		""
		"When toggled, prevents Spiritual damage if it falls below 50% of your Max HP."
	]
	quest.5099A249A80DB9D5.quest_subtitle: "&f&lTips"
	quest.5099A249A80DB9D5.title: "&#D554BE&lSpiritual Attack Resistance"
	quest.5345957B8ACBD375.quest_desc: ["Here is some starter items : )"]
	quest.5345957B8ACBD375.quest_subtitle: "Baby steps"
	quest.534E6144323748DB.quest_desc: ["Placing lapis inside the imbuement chamber makes souce gems (useful for later recipies)."]
	quest.53C5E4504F663874.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive - Toggle] Flame Aura: Adds Flame Damage to the player's physical and aura attacks equal to 50% of their base damage. Costs 200 MP per attack. Increases Flame Damage by 2x."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Press] Rage: Grants the player Strengthen 10 (20 with Mastery) buff for 5 Minutes on activation. Costs 300 MP"
		""
		"[Active - Press] Mad Ogre: Grants the player a strength 15 (30 with Mastery) buff (doesn't stack with rage), doubles their size (+2 reach and +1 step height), gives them +0.4 (0.8 with Mastery) Knockback Resistance, +0.04 Speed, and gives them 20 (40 with Mastery) armors for 10 minutes. During the duration the player is inflicted with the Rampage Debuff. After the duration gives the player Fragility 2, weakness 2, and Paralysis 2 for 10 minutes. Costs 5,000 MP."
		""
		"With Mastery, 6 spheres of fire spawn behind the player and on activation again, one will be sent flying towards where the player is looking, exploding and dealing 100 damage. When sneaking, the player can no longer send the orbs flying, but direct attacks from others landing on the player will trigger an orb to explode instantly and halve the damage that the player would take. The Flame Orbs will regenerate 20 seconds after being used in any way."
	]
	quest.53C5E4504F663874.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.53C5E4504F663874.title: "&f&lBerserk"
	quest.53D8F3C2762D3D43.title: "&f&lMark"
	quest.5426A0B51E97E9BA.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive, In Slot] Aortic Work of Art:"
		"When attacking, mark your enemies’ blood vessels. Every slash from a physical weapon grants the target +1 mark."
		"--If the target reaches 5 marks, the following happens: If the target dies, they explode in a burst of burning blood, dealing splash damage and igniting other nearby enemies on fire."
		""
		"--If the target reaches 10 marks, the following happens: Rupture an increasing number of blood vessels every 10 seconds, dealing 5% of your target's maximum health until they perish."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, Press] Heighten:"
		"On activating this mode, gain an instant increase in blood flow for a short period of time, allowing you to react faster, move faster and attack faster."
		""
		"[Active, Press] Rupture:"
		"If the target is marked with at least 15 marks, remotely Rupture their blood vessels. It will slowly trickle down their health until they die, and this effect cannot be removed unless using a Predation skill to isolate the effects."
		""
		"If the target dies, they will explode in a violent burst of burning blood."
		""
		"[Art, Press] 血淋林的爱:"
		"After killing an entity with over 10 marks, gain a charge for (血淋淋的爱)."
		""
		"Open a GUI, where the latest target you attack will be displayed. A model of the target’s anatomy is shown. You have up to three slashes. CLICK on their anatomy to choose where to butcher."
		""
		"Save and confirm your choice with the Decapitate button. On confirming, sever the blood flow to those parts, PERMANENTLY until they die."
		"If the target has any form of regeneration skill, this effect can be reduced."
		"No regeneration skills -> Infinite duration."
		"Self Regeneration toggled on (prior to being affected) -> 2 minutes."
		"Ultraspeed Regeneration/Survivor toggled on (prior to being affected) -> 1 minutes."
		"Infinite Regeneration toggled on (prior to being affected) -> 15 seconds."
		""
		"-Leg: Halves your ability to jump or move."
		"-Arm: Cooldowns multiplied by 1.5x for one. Multiplied by 2x for both. Additionally halves attack damage and attack power per arm. Makes the target- unable to attack if both arms are failing."
		"-Torso: Mutilate the target and consume their heart, dealing high damage and healing the user for the damage dealt."
	]
	quest.5426A0B51E97E9BA.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.5426A0B51E97E9BA.title: "&f&lButcher"
	quest.547660781073AE96.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive, True] Magical Prodigy - Instant learning and mastery of obtained spells. Concentrator is obtained upon acquiring."
		""
		"[Passive, In slot] Magic Cancel - (Requires Mastery) Upon being hit by an ability, every mode of that ability will be set to a minimum of 300 seconds of cooldown (5 minutes, configurable). This ability has a 60 second cooldown."
		""
		"[Passive, Toggled] Arcane Blessing - Magic, holy, and spiritual damage and multiplied by 2 when dealt by the user."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, Press]Demon Seal - At the cost of 50k Magicules, the user can tame a spiritual player with 40% or less of their EP temporarily, OR tame a spiritual mob with 80% or less of their EP temporarily."
		""
		"[Active, Held] Key’s Defense - While held, the user pays 50 Magicules per point of damage blocked. Physical, fire based, and water based attacks are blocked using Magicules. Player’s movement speed is divided in 2 for this duration."
	]
	quest.547660781073AE96.title: "&f&lLemengeton"
	quest.54D1601DFA1DEC24.title: "&f&lKirara"
	quest.55734DC9363734BF.quest_desc: [""]
