	quest.55734DC9363734BF.title: "&#4E6ECD&lEnergy Harbinger"
	quest.56212AD70F721F28.quest_subtitle: "Only B rank and above can purchase this"
	quest.56448EBBDC8E3467.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lActive"
		"Active - Press] Predation : On use, creates a black mist (breath) in a 2 block radius in front of the player. If it comes into contact with a mob, deals 10 damage and drains 100MP, with a 10% chance to gain one random Intrinsic, Common, Extra, or Resist skill from the target. If an enemy is killed by Predation, gains all of their Intrinsic, Common, Extra, and Resist skills. With Mastery, the mist is capable of eating projectiles. Targets killed have 50% of their ep added to the players instead of the usual 5%[a]. The other 50% will be added to Stomach's energy storage. Shift-activate to toggled on/off consume-block-mode, which will automatically be added to Stomach. (EP absorb only applies for the first target of that type)"
		""
		"[Active - Hold] Corrosion: When activated while looking at nothing, costs 200 MP and deals 5 corrosion damage every 10 ticks to all enemies in a 10x10 radius. Enemies killed by this have their Intrinsic, Common, and Extra Skills taken by the player as well as have 50% of their ep added to the player's maximum.The other 50% is added to Stomach's energy storage. (25% to MP, 25% to AP)"
		""
		"[Active - Press] Stomach : When activated, grants access to a spatial storage with the size of a chest with 7 rows. Items are able to be stacked to 200 instead of 64."
		""
		"[Active - Press] Receive: When activated while looking at a subordinate: Resistances, Intrinsic, Common and Extra skills owned by it are given to the player."
	]
	quest.56448EBBDC8E3467.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.56448EBBDC8E3467.title: "&f&lGourmet"
	quest.56493569CA93E660.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive, Toggle] Fountain of Youth - Gain Costless regenration, Thought Accceleration, a 50% to Steal Mp from a hit entity and as these immunities:"
		"Abnormal Conditions"
		"Chill"
		"Rest"
		"Sleep"
		"&0&lActives"
		"[Active, Press] Physical Hunt - When used while looking at a target in a 20 block range, apply fragility to it and Strengthen, Haste and Resistance to the User. The user also gains an attack damage bonus equal to 75% of the Targets attack damage"
		"Sneak Usage lets this Mode affect all Entities in a 20 block radius with longer CD"
		""
		"[Active, Press] Fox Hunt (requires learning) - If a looked at Entity has less EP than the User, kill the entity and gain Its EP (like Reapers Infinte Eater). If used against the same entity type again, instead gain 25% instead."
		"Sneak Usage makes this be an Aoe with longer Cooldown"
		""
		"[Active, Hold] Zero Sign - On holding, Gain presence Concealment aswell as a +5 attack boost per entity in a 15 block radius"
	]
	quest.56493569CA93E660.title: "&f&lSnatch"
	quest.56538F58FC380639.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive - In Slot] - Whenever the user takes damage, add an equal amount of Echo Points as the amount of damage, the skill must be in Skill Slots."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Press] - Echo Reflection: Consumes all of the player's Echo Points and unleash an electric projectile that deals damage equal to their Echo Points x3 (x5 with Mastery). Scroll mouse while sneak holding down this mode to change the power output percentage."
		""
		"[Active - Hold] - Echo Counter: While held down, the user cannot move or attack if not mastered, but the next attack they take will be canceled and reflect that damage back to the attacker. If the attack is not Projectile, the damage is reflected directly back to the attacker with x2.5 force. If the attack type is Projectile, the projectile will go back to its owner with x2 speed and x2.5 damage if it’s a Magic Projectile. Cooldown 5s."
	]
	quest.56538F58FC380639.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.56538F58FC380639.title: "&f&lReflector"
	quest.56DBC6D9FA1BF5E6.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive, True] Beloved by Energy:"
		"The user's magicule and aura regeneration rate is increased by 10x."
		""
		"[Passive, Toggle] Purification:"
		"All of the user's attacks and abilities cost 50% less energy to utilize, be it Aura or Magicules. On mastery, all abilities cost 66% less energy."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, Toggle] Emancipation:"
		"On toggling this ability on, you will deal additional Holy Damage (1.75x) on top of whatever damage you were dealing. Press again to toggle the ability off. Costs 2000 Magicules to toggle on, and 300 to maintain every second. This cost is affected by (Purification)."
		""
		"[Active, Press] Purity Edge:"
		"The ability to channel pure holy spiritrons into your blade. For the next 3 seconds (5 on mastery) after activation, the user's next physical strike with a weapon is greatly empowered! It will instantly deal 25% of the target's health in damage, multiplied by 2 if the target is a Majin."
		""
		"On mastery, this upgrades to 50%, which will one shot all majins without one-shot protection."
		""
		"However, beware the drawback. Failure to channel your energy in time will cause the Holy Energy to recoil and damage the user instead, dealing 75% HP (50% HP on mastery) in damage to the user. Cooldown of 120 seconds, reducing to 60 on mastery."
		""
		"Costs 10,000 Magicules to activate, which is affected by (Purification)."
	]
	quest.56DBC6D9FA1BF5E6.title: "&f&lReducer"
	quest.573FF42985129742.quest_desc: ["Consumues and converts heated water to power. Place a heat source below it and a water supply into it to start power generation. This can be done with the create mod pipe system (w/ fluid tank, water pump, etc)"]
	quest.573FF42985129742.title: "&f&lThermo Generator"
	quest.575FA02F063F907F.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive - Toggle] Recon - Cannot toggle when Attack is activated. Reduces player size by half, gives the user +1 Presence Sense level, + 10 Presence Sense Radius (20 with Mastery), highlights all mobs within the sensing radius area in white. Grants a 10% (20% with Mastery) Physical Attack auto-dodge chance."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Press] - Attack - Cannot activate when Recon is toggled. While holding down, scroll mouse to choose the number of clones to summon, up to 5 clones. Upon release the skill button, reduces player size by half, reduces EP by 50% (lasts until disabled) and spawns the chosen number of clones (shift to have Alex model, else Steve model) with identical stats to the player and 50% EP divided evenly to every clone. Activate again to disable, having EP back to 100%"
		""
		"[Active - Press] - Infinite Eater (Requires Learning) - Requires both Recon and Attack Mode to be inactive. When activated while looking at a target, if their EP is equal to or lower than the user's, they're insta-killed and 50% of the target’s EP is consumed (EP gain only applies for the first target of that type). Costs as much MP as the target’s EP. Will recover magicule when succeeded. Cooldown 10s (5s with Mastery)"
	]
	quest.575FA02F063F907F.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.575FA02F063F907F.title: "&f&lReaper"
	quest.57C29B8358883E6C.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive, True] Spatial Barriers:"
		"The user learns Barrier, Spatial Manipulation, Spatial Motion"
		""
		"&0&lActives"
		"[Active, In-slot] Barrier Refinement:"
		"While this mode is in-slot, the user doubles all Barrier Points they gain."
		""
		"[Active, Press] Counter Barrier:"
		"The user can use this mode on any projectiles, instantly destroying them. The cost 100 Barrier Points to use MP."
		""
		"[Active, Press] Stability:"
		"The user can remove all of their Barrier Points to restore their MP and HP based off the Barrier Points."
		"1 Barrier Point = 100 MP"
		"1 Barrier Point = 5 HP"
	]
	quest.57C29B8358883E6C.title: "&f&lElegy"
	quest.586BB76BF13B7D70.quest_desc: [
