	quest.587A8E8BF6954309.title: "&4&lTime For Conquest"
	quest.5905D4423CF60D55.quest_desc: [
		"&6&lObtainment"
		"Mastering Infinity Prison. ( Will Not be lost in Evolution. ) "
		"Requires 2 Million MP. ( Will be lost in Evolution )"
		"True Hero / True Demon Lord Evolution"
		""
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[True Passive] Increase Mastery and Learning Progress of Skills by 2x as Well as EP gain."
		""
		"[Passive - Toggle] When hitting a Player, Take away 1% of their temporary MP with a 10% Chance."
		""
		"[Passive - Toggle] Grants following Buffs under Specific Circumstances:"
		"When below 80% HP: Grants Strengh III"
		"When below 60% HP: Grants Strengh VI"
		"When below 40% HP: Grants Strengh IX"
		"When below 20% HP: Grants Strengh XIII and reduces taken Damage by 30%"
		""
		"[Passive - Toggle] When in a 5x5 Radius around the Player, Grants the Target/-s Slowness II, Weakness II and Blindness I."
		""
		"[Passive - In Slot] When hitting a Target, the Targets gainst Infinite imprisonment I for 2 Seconds."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Press] Taker's will"
		"The Targets HP are lowered by 10% every 10 Seconds for 1 Minute, If the Target has Magic resistance toggled, lower Targets HP by 5% and If Magic Nullification is toggled, lower Targets HP by 1%. Cooldown: 120s"
		""
		"[Active - Press] Power Hunger"
		"Copy Skills of the Target with following Rules:"
		"Only Intrinsics, Resistances/Nullifications, Commons and Extras can be copied."
		"With a 10% Chance Copy 2 skills and with a 5% Chance Copy 3 Skills"
		"Cooldown after each Copy: 10s"
		""
		"[Active - Press] Room"
		"Create a 3x3 large Room in which everyone will gain the Effect Infinite Imprisonment II for 30 Seconds who is in that Area."
		"Cooldown: 120s"
		""
		"[Active - Hold] Isolation"
		"After looking at a Target for 10 Seconds, temporarily deactivate all Skills for 5 Seconds. Cooldown: 30s "
		"[Active - Press] Divine Lifesteal"
		"Deal 5k Spatial Damage as Well 5k Holy Damage to all Entitites in a 5x5 Radius around the Player. When Spatial/Holy resistance toggled, deal 2k Spatial and Holy Damage and when Spatial/Holy Nullification is toggled, the damage is ignored. "
		"Cooldown: 120s"
	]
	quest.5905D4423CF60D55.title: "&4&lKronairos, Lord of the Endless"
	quest.59514E952CFC60F1.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive - In Slot] - Anti-Skill (A skill only accessible through Creation, rng unique from shop and certain quest) (Toggleable with Creators' Mastery) Makes the user immune to Magic, Skills, and Battlewill. When punching a Ranged Barrier, instantly destroy it. When attacking a target when both hand empty (only empty main hand with Creator’s Mastery), remove all barrier points from target and inflict a debuff on target that makes Skills unable to be activated for 4s."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Press] - Analytical Appraisal: Analysis Level 1 (2 with Mastery), distance 5 blocks (10 with Mastery), If a target has greater than 2x (4x with Mastery) the player's EP, then only its base stats are shown (Name, HP, SHP, Armor)."
		""
		"[Active - Press] - Skill Creation: When used, allows the player to select one Unique Skill or Anti-Skill, which is then granted to the user for 20 minutes (1 MC day). Cannot create the same skill twice in a row without Mastery. All skills gained via a copy/plunder skill obtained through Creator are considered temporary, and will be removed once the copy/plunder skill is removed"
		""
		"&4&lAny skill created through Creator that would grant a/multiple secondary skills, will not grant said skills. Skills copied/stolen with created skill will dissapear when ability is off"
	]
	quest.59514E952CFC60F1.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.59514E952CFC60F1.title: "&f&lCreator"
	quest.59D6D52DFB931CAA.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassives"
		"Passive (true) - Uzumaki Vitality"
		"- Increases maximum Health and maximum Magicules by 10%."
		"Restores 1 Health every 4 sec."
		"Restores 100 Magicules per sec, increased to 200 per sec when mastered."
		""
		"Passive (true) - My Ninja Way"
		"- While below 50% Health, increases movement speed and the user's outgoing damage by 20%."
		"- Mastered bonus: 30% movement speed and outgoing damage."
		""
		"Passive (true) - Nine-Tails Chakra"
		"- After surviving damage at or below 25% Health, automatically enters Nine-Tails Chakra for 15 sec."
		"- Increases movement speed by 20%, outgoing damage by 25%, and knockback resistance by 50%."
		"- Heals 2% of maximum Health every sec."
		"- Cooldown: 4 min. Mastered cooldown: 3 min."
		""
		"&0&lActives"
		"Active (press) - Shadow Clone Jutsu"
		"- Summons native shadow clones around the user. Shift-click the ability to switch between its two internal modes"
		""
		"&o(Multi-Shadow Clone Mode)&r"
		"- Normal: summons 30 clones for 15 sec."
		"- Mastered: summons 50 clones for 30 sec."
		"- Each clone takes one damaging hit to destroy."
		"- Each clone deals a fixed 5 damage on its first successful attack, then disperses."
		""
		"&o(Attack Mode)&r"
		"- Normal: summons 4 clones for 2 min; each takes one damaging hit to destroy."
		"- Mastered: summons 8 clones for 4 min; each takes two damaging hits to destroy."
		"- Each clone deals 25% of the user's Attack Damage and can attack once per sec."
		"- Attack Mode clones remain active after attacking."
		""
		"&oShared Rules:&r"
		"- Cost: 15% of maximum Magicules."
		"- Cooldown: 60 sec."
		"- Mastered cooldown: 45 sec."
		"- Both internal modes share one cooldown."
		"- Recasting replaces all existing Nindo clones."
		"- Clones prioritize the user's last attacked target or latest attacker."
		"- Enemies already targeting the user within 18 blocks are redirected among the clones."
		""
		"Active (press) - Substitution Jutsu"
		""
		"Prepares a one-hit replacement for 5 sec. The next valid damaging attack from another living attacker (or a projectile) is canceled."
		""
		"Leaves a substitution log at the user's original position for 3 sec."
		"Teleports behind the attacker."
		"Cost: 1,000 Magicules when prepared."
		"Cooldown begins when prepared: 90 sec."
		"Mastered cooldown: 60 sec."
		""
		"Active (press) - Rasengan"
		""
		"Lunges toward the closest enemy in the user's crosshair within 6 blocks and strikes with Severance damage."
		""
		"Cost: 3,000 Magicules."
		"Base damage: 50-450, scaling with the user's EP (reaches max at around 500k ep"
		"Strongly knocks the target backward and upward."
		"Cooldown: 60 sec."
		"Mastered cooldown: 40 sec."
		""
		"Active (press, requires mastery) - Rasen Shuriken"
		""
		"Charges for 3 sec, then launches a Rasen Shuriken in the direction the user is looking."
		""
		"Launch cost: 30,000 Magicules."
		"Successful-launch cooldown: 8 min."
		"Maximum flight time: 5 sec."
		"Explosion radius: 6 blocks."
		"Deals 200 Severance damage on impact, followed by 8 pulses of 75 Severance damage."
	]
	quest.59D6D52DFB931CAA.title: "&f&lNindo"
	quest.5A207DAC0E4A37AA.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive - Toggle] Silent Movement : The player makes zero noise, undetectable by Sculk or Sense Sound Wave."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Hold] - Presence Concealment : When held, makes the player completely invisible and undetectable by any sensory abilities until the player runs out of energy. While in slot, dealing extra 50 (150 with mastery) physical damage while concealed. Costs 50 MP per 20 ticks. Becomes toggleable with mastery."
	]
	quest.5A207DAC0E4A37AA.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.5A207DAC0E4A37AA.title: "&f&lMurderer"
	quest.5A64048FA582217A.quest_desc: [
		"&f&lPassives"
		"Passive (true) -  Cardinal Weapon"
		""
		"The user permanently gains the Cardinal Shield in their offhand."
		""
		"Grants +30 Armor"
		"Functions as an unbreakable shield with no durability."
		"Cannot be moved, swapped, stored, dropped, destroyed, or duplicated."
		"Temporarily moves to the main hand during Chimera Viper Shield."
		""
		"Passive (true) -  Hero of the Shield"
		""
		"Normal melee weapon damage is completely nullified."
		"Ranged weapons deal no damage."
		"Dead End Rainbow cannot be used."
		"Damage caused by skills still work"
		"Chimera Viper Shield is the only Cardinal Shield transformation permitted to deal normal melee strikes."
		""
		"Passive (true) -  Hero’s Party"
		""
		"Direct kills grant an additional 3% of the defeated target’s EP."
		"Kills made by a Slave Crest subordinate also grant the Shield Hero the normal player EP"
		""
		"Passive (true) -  Defensive Barrier"
		""
		"Raising the Cardinal Shield automatically deploys eight orbiting Air Strike Shields around the user."
		""
		"Forms a 360-degree barrier"
		"Attacks are completely blocked."
		"Each blocked attack consumes one Air Strike stock."
		"Hostile creatures are pushed outside the barrier."
		"Allies, pets, Slave Crest subordinates, and owned summons may safely pass through."
		"Maximum stock is 12, increased to 20 after mastery."
		"One stock regenerates every 12 seconds, reduced to 8 seconds after mastery."
		"Regenerating one stock costs 500 Magicules."
		"The barrier becomes inactive at zero stock, while charging an Air Strike launch, or while Dog Bite Shield is transformed."
		""
		"&0&lActives"
		"Active (press/hold) - Air Strike Shield [Launch]"
		""
		"Crouch and activate the Air Strike Shield mode to form a large forward-facing shield. Continue holding the activation key to charge it, then release to launch it."
		""
		"Tap damage: 25"
		"One-second charge damage: 40"
		"Two-second charge damage: 55, with increased size and impact radius"
		"Maximum travel range: 20 blocks"
		"Launch cost: 600 Magicules and one Air Strike stock"
		""
		"Active (press) - Slave Crest"
		""
		"Places a permanent Slave Crest upon a weakened, nameable creature and converts it into the Shield Hero’s subordinate."
		""
		"Magicule cost: 3,000"
		"Cooldown: 10 minutes"
		"The target’s EP cannot exceed 15% of the Shield Hero’s EP."
		"The target must be below 10% health before it can be bound."
		"The health requirement is ignored when the target has less than 5% of the Shield Hero’s EP."
		"Successful targets receive an Endow-tier naming (Without the regular cost)"
		"Subordinates are permanently named in order as Slave #1, Slave #2, Slave #3, and so on."
		""
		"Active (press) - Dog Bite Shield"
		""
		"Transforms the Cardinal Shield into the fanged Dog Bite Shield and creates an eight-second retaliation field."
		""
		"Duration: 8 seconds"
		"Magicule cost: 1,500"
		"Cooldown: 4 minutes, beginning when the transformation ends"
		"Every attack is negated."
		"Remains active for the entire eight-second duration."
		"Against attackers with equal or lower EP, it reflects 180% of the incoming damage."
		"Against attackers with higher EP, it reflects 80% of the incoming damage."
		""
		"Active (press) - Shield Prison"
		""
		"Surrounds a targeted enemy with four shields and binding chains, restraining them at the location where the prison formed."
		""
		"Targeting range: 25 blocks with direct line of sight"
		"Magicule cost: 2,000"
		"Cooldown: 2 minutes"
		"Normal duration: Up to 8 seconds"
		"Duration against players or targets with at least 200 maximum health: Up to 4 seconds"
		"Restrained targets cannot move but may still turn and attack."
		"Active (press) - Chimera Viper Shield"
		""
		"Transforms the Cardinal Shield into a weapon and temporarily moves it into the user’s main hand."
		""
		"Duration: 10 seconds"
		"Magicule cost: None"
		"Cooldown: 10 minutes, reduced to 7 minutes after mastery"
		"Attack damage scales with ep"
		"Maximum damage: 250"
		"Every successful strike inflicts Poison II for 5 seconds."
		"The first strike against each target during a transformation inflicts Paralysis for 2 seconds."
		"The item displaced from the selected hotbar slot is safely stored and restored when the transformation ends."
		""
		"The Cardinal Shield permanently receives the following weapon engravings after Chimera Viper Shield is first activated."
		""
		"Severance I: Damage becomes difficult to heal and gains +3 damage."
		"Soul Eater I: Imbues attacks with Spiritual Damage."
		"Slotting III: Allows up to three elemental cores to be inserted."
		"Elemental Boost II: Increases natural-effect damage by up to 20%."
		"Intangibility I: Allows attacks to ignore armor and shields."
	]
