	quest.5B97D04768CA11AC.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive - True] - With mastery, makes the player immune to severance."
		""
		"[Passive - Toggle] - Thought Acceleration"
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		""
		"[Active - Press] Spatial Suppression: Inflicts a status debuff to all mobs within a 50x50 radius that prevents them from using teleportation abilities for 60 seconds. Costs 300 MP."
		""
		"[Active - Press] - Swap: When activated, the player and the mob/enemy/entity that they're looking at swap places [Max range 30 blocks]. Costs 100 MP."
		""
		"[Active - Press] - Spatial Motion: Blink if not shifting (Costs 10 per block distance), Spatial GUI if shifting (Costs 10 per block distance for instant warp, 5 per for portal)"
