	quest.5C6106C5727D8D07.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive - Toggle + In Slot] Spatial Manipulation: x2 Spatial Damage and Warp Shot [In Slot while in this Mode]"
		"--When active, non-magic projectiles (Arrows, Spear, Kunai, Sniper Bullet, Web Bullet, Potions, Thrown Item (from Thrower), Egg, Ender Pearl, Firework Rocket, Snowball, Trident) will automatically warp to the back of the looked-at target's head and shot at the speed of the original speed multiplied by the warp shot level. Sneak to not warp shot while shooting. Cost 50 MP each warp."
		""
		"--When activated, grant the user warp shot level of 0.5. Press again to deactivate. (Stackable)"
		""
		"[Passive - Toggle] - Magic Sense : Same as normal. Treated as Mastered."
		""
		"[Passive - Toggle] - Predictive Calculation : 10% Chance to auto-dodge an attack. 50% Chance to ignore dodge on enemies. Nullification is treated as resistance and resistance is bypassed. Magic Jamming's damage mitigation is ignored."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		""
		"[Active - Press] Create Weapon : If used when not looking at a mob, creates a Walther P99 Pistol in the player's empty hand [Sneak Right-clicking to change Bullet Mode: Magic and Physical. Physical Bullet consumes 100 AP and deals 30 Physical Damage - 1s (0s with mastery) cooldown, Magic Bullet consumes 100 MP and deals 100 (200 with Mastery) Magic Damage - 3s (0s with mastery) cooldown. If Sniper is actively in a slot and is mastered, the bullets will teleport behind a looked at enemy when fired instead]. If activated while looking at an entity or already having a pistol in 1 hand, throws a grenade at the mob which explodes and deals damage in a 5x5 block radius - 3s cooldown (1s with mastery)."
		"--Magic Bullet will apply severance if Warp Shot is active"
	]
	quest.5C6106C5727D8D07.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.5C6106C5727D8D07.title: "&f&lSniper"
	quest.5C6243A3B42025B0.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lActive"
		""
		"[Active - Press] - Inverted Fusion [Buff]: When activated, removes all negative status effects (besides some exception like Magicule Poisoning) from the player if looking at nothing or the looked at mob/player and grants buffs based on the status effect removed (if applicable). Paralysis, Slowness = Speed; Poison, Corrosion, Wither = Regeneration; Burden = Slow Falling + Speed + Jump Boost; Fragility = Resistance; Mining Fatigue = Haste, Hunger = Saturation; Bad Luck = Luck, Weakness = Strength, Night Vision = Blindness/Darkness, Invisibility = Glowing etc."
		""
		"[Active - Press] - Inverted Fusion [Debuff]: Invert the possible reverse Above"
		"--Inverted fusion becomes toggleable with mastery. Once toggled, it will automatically inverse any negative effect applied."
		""
		"--Reversing now respects the ratio of reversed effects (for example, Resistance = Fragility II)."
		""
		"--Can reverse effects on potion items on entities with mastery."
		""
		"[Active - Press] - Alignment Reverse: If the player is a Majin, Holy or True Hero(TH), sets Alignment to Chaos (Which can be seen as it changes the Race name color to Red). When the alignment is set to Chaos, the player can become TH when their race is Majin. Chaos-aligned beings are no longer affected by Holy Coat, and no longer take extra damage from Charybdis's Wicked Light Ray. With Mastery, you can set the alignment of other players or mobs to Chaos."
	]
	quest.5C6243A3B42025B0.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.5C6243A3B42025B0.title: "&f&lReverser"
	quest.5C625CABD0FD179B.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassives"
		"Passive (true) - Heian Apex"
		""
		"Grants overwhelming combat talent and accelerated learning."
		""
		"Increases the user's outgoing damage by 5%."
		"At mastery, the damage increase becomes 10%."
		"Stacks multiplicatively with Bind Vitality's damage bonus."
		"Adds 5 Learned Points whenever the user learns another skill."
		"Malevolent cannot grant its learning bonus to itself."
		""
		"Passive (true) - King of Curses"
		""
		"Grants Curse Spiritual Magic and Curse Bind Spiritual Magic if the user does not already possess them."
		"Curse and Curse Bind cost 0 Magicules while Malevolent is owned."
		"Their regular cooldowns are reduced by 50%."
		"This cooldown reduction stacks multiplicatively with Bind Mana."
		"With Bind Mana active, Curse and Curse Bind use 37.5% of their original cooldown."
		"If the user already owned either magic before learning Malevolent, it is not removed when Malevolent is lost."
		""
		"Passive (true) - Reverse Cursed Technique"
		""
		"Heals 3 HP every second while the user is injured."
		"Requires the user to have at least 1 current Magicule."
		""
		"&0&lActives"
		"Active (shift + press to select / press to invoke) - Binding Vow"
		""
		"Allows the user to sacrifice part of a core resource for extreme permanent power during that life."
		""
		"Shift + press cycles between Bind Vitality and Bind Mana."
		"Press invokes the currently selected vow."
		"Each vow can be invoked once per life."
		"Bind Vitality and Bind Mana can both be active during the same life."
		"Actual death and respawn reset both vows for the next life."
		""
		"Bind Vitality:"
		""
		"Seals 30% of current maximum Health capacity normally."
		"At mastery, only 20% is sealed."
		"Healing cannot exceed the active cap."
		"Increases outgoing damage by 25%."
		"Increases attack speed by 25%."
		"Increases movement speed by 25% while sprinting."
		"Stacks multiplicatively with Heian Apex."
		""
		"Bind Mana:"
		""
		"Seals 30% of max mp capacity"
		"At mastery, only 20% is sealed."
		"mp regeneration and direct restoration cannot exceed the active cap."
		"Reduces skill cooldowns by 25%."
		"Shortens casting times by 25%."
		"Increases critical attack chance by 25%."
		"Stacks multiplicatively with King of Curses"
		""
		"Bind Mana also reduces Malevolent ability cd"
		"Active (press) - Dismantle"
		""
		"Launches a fast blood-red severance slash that pierces through terrain and enemies."
		""
		"Travels up to 32 blocks."
		"Can strike multiple enemies"
		"Deals 60 impact damage normally / 120 when mastered."
		"Bypasses Resistance."
		"Applies Hemorrhage for 4 sec normally / 8 sec when mastered."
		"Hemorrhage deals one additional slash each second for 15 damage normally / 30 when mastered."
		"Cost: 5,000 MP."
		"Cooldown: 20 sec normally / 15 sec when mastered."
		"With Bind Mana: 15 sec normally / 12 sec when mastered."
		""
		"Hemorrhage:"
		"Malevolent's slashes leave wounds that reject high-level regeneration"
		""
		"Prevents Infinite Regeneration and Ultraspeed Regeneration from activating or continuing."
		"Any active Infinite or Ultraspeed Regeneration is disabled."
		""
		"Active (press) - Cleave"
		""
		"Requires a visible valid enemy within 2 blocks."
		"EP-scaled damage begins at 66 and rises to 666."
		"Maximum EP scaling is reached around 500,000 EP."
		"Also calculates 20% of the target's maximum Health normally / 35% when mastered."
		"Uses whichever damage result is greater."
		"Deals Severance damage with Resistance/nullification bypass."
		"Applies Hemorrhage for 10 sec."
		"Grants 5 mastery when it successfully damages the target."
		"Cost: 15,000 Magicules."
		"Cooldown: 90 sec normally / 60 sec when mastered."
		""
		"Active (press - requires mastery) - Fuga"
		""
		"Needs 1.5-sec to form"
		"Maximum travel range: 40 blocks."
		"Deals Fire Elemental damage scaling with EP from 300 to 900."
		"Maximum damage scaling is reached around 500k EP."
		"Damage falls with distance"
		"Deals 25% increased damage to Hemorrhaging targets and consumes Hemorrhage."
		"Cost: 40,000 Magicules."
		"Cooldown: 5 minutes / 225 sec with Bind Mana."
	]
