	quest.5D8BCE45DA6EDED7.title: "&f&lObtain A Medium Spirit Of Water"
	quest.5DC1CA3C0D6A3785.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassives"
		"Passive (true) - Brand of Sacrifice"
		"- Every natural night, waves of branded undead spawn around the user and relentlessly pursue them."
		"- The first wave begins when night is detected; another wave attempts to spawn every 60 sec."
		"- Sacrificed enemies spawn 12-28 blocks away and are chosen from Zombies, Skeletons, Husks, Strays, and Drowned."
		"- Every Sacrificed enemy bears the Brand of Sacrifice above its head and is forced to target its assigned Black Swordsman."
		"- Wave size, population cap, stats, and resistance bypass scale with the user's EP."
		"- At sunrise, all remaining Sacrificed enemies burn away and despawn."
		"- Sacrificed enemies are also removed if their owner dies, logs out, changes dimensions, or loses the skill."
		"- Brand of Sacrifice is inactive in dimensions without a natural day/night sky cycle."
		""
		"Passive (true) - Heap of Iron"
		"- Grants complete mastery over Great Sword-class weapons."
		"- Instantly unlocks the Great Sword schematic."
		"- Great Sword direct melee attacks deal 1.5x normal damage."
		"- Great Swords attack at twice the normal speed, reducing their attack-cooldown time by 50%."
		"- Great Sword direct melee attacks bypass Physical Attack Resistance and Physical Attack Nullification."
		"- While wielded by a Black Swordsman, Great Swords are visually replaced by Dragon Slayer"
		""
		"Passive (true) - Rage"
		"- Turns accumulated suffering into greater offensive power at the cost of increased vulnerability."
		"- Normally, cumulative damage equal to 60% of maximum HP grants 1 Rage."
		"- After mastery, the requirement is reduced to 35% of maximum HP."
		"- Maximum Rage: 10 normally, or 15 when mastered."
		"- Each stack increases all outgoing damage by 2%."
		"- Each stack also increases incoming damage by 0.5%."
		"- Taking damage resets the decay timer."
		"- After 30 seconds without taking damage, Rage decays by 1 stack every 30 seconds."
		"- Death and respawning reset Rage and its accumulated progress to 0."
		"- The current Rage count appears in the action bar whenever stacks change, reset, or mastery increases the maximum."
		""
		"Passive (toggle requires mastery) - Dragon Slayer"
		"- Unleashes Dragon Slayer's full spiritual killing power through Great Sword attacks."
		"- Only applies to successful direct melee hits with a Great Sword."
		"- Costs 600 Magicules per successful hit."
		"- The physical hit bypasses the target's normal armor reduction."
		"- Also deals direct spiritual health (SHP) damage equal to 2x the completed Great Sword physical-damage reference."
		"- Heap of Iron continues to bypass Physical Attack Resistance and Physical Attack Nullification."
		"- If the user cannot pay the 600-Magicule cost, Dragon Slayer automatically toggles off."
		""
		"&0&lActives"
		"Active (press) - Arrow Volley"
		"- Rapidly launches five physical arrows forward from the user's left hand."
		"- Fires one arrow per server tick, completing the five-shot volley in about 0.2 seconds."
		"- Each arrow deals 25 Severance damage, increased to 50 when mastered."
		"- All five arrows can damage the same target."
		"- Cost: 5,500 Magicules per volley."
		"- Cooldown: 30 seconds normally, or 20 seconds when mastered."
		"- Volley arrows cannot be collected and are automatically deleted on entity impact, block impact, or after 5 seconds."
		""
		"Active (press) - Cannon"
		"- Launches a cannonball forward from the user's left hand."
		"- A direct hit deals 250 Severance damage, increased to 500 when mastered."
		"- Impact creates a radius-4 explosion that deals area damage."
		"- Direct targets receive strong knockback, while the user receives a small amount of recoil when firing."
		"- Cost: 15,000 Magicules."
		"- Cooldown: 150 seconds normally, or 110 seconds when mastered."
	]
	quest.5DC1CA3C0D6A3785.title: "&f&lBlack Swordsman"
