	quest.5E97E43F10A864F0.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive - Toggle + In Slot] - Spatial Manipulation: x2 Spatial Damage [Toggle] and Warp Shot [In Slot while in this Mode]"
		"--When active, non-magic projectiles (Arrows, Spear, Kunai, Sniper Bullet, Web Bullet, Potions, Thrown Item (from Thrower), Egg, Ender Pearl, Firework Rocket, Snowball, Trident) will automatically warp to the back of the looked-at target's head and shot at the speed of the original speed multiplied by the warp shot level. Sneak to not warp shot while shooting. Cost 50 MP each warp."
		""
		"--When activated, grant the user warp shot level of 0.5. Press again to deactivate. (Stackable)"
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Press] - Instant Motion: Teleports the player to where they're looking instantly. Costs 5 MP per block distance. Range 200 Blocks. 5 Seconds Cooldown."
		""
		"[Active - Press] - Teleport: Opens Spatial Motion GUI. Costs 5 MP per block distance for instant warp, 25 per for portal. 10 second cooldown(5 with mastery)"
		""
		"[Active - Press] - Stardust Arrow (Requires Learning): Launches a singular energy arrow where the player is looking that deals 30 damage and applies severance [Sneak to apply warp shot on the arrow]. Costs 100 MP and 100 AP."
		""
		"[Active - Press] - Stardust Rain (Requires Mastery + Learning): Launches energy arrows from 360⁰ in a sphere around the looked at enemy [Radius: 20 Blocks]. Costs 5000 AP and 5000 MP. Each arrow does 30 Damage and applies a Severance effect [Around 10-12 arrows at once]. 5 second cooldown(4 seconds with mastery)"
	]
	quest.5E97E43F10A864F0.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.5E97E43F10A864F0.title: "&f&lTraveler"
	quest.60073121A16F4F9E.quest_desc: ["Here are the basic materials you will need to craft the eggs of the otherworlders. Each egg will require 5k source (half of a full jar). Next part should be a little easier."]
	quest.60073121A16F4F9E.quest_subtitle: "&f&lSpawn Eggs"
	quest.60073121A16F4F9E.title: "&4&lOtherworlders"
	quest.6038ABE5182D3C77.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive, Toggled] Black Flash: There is a 1% chance for melee attacks to have black flash applied on hit. This will multiply damage dealt by 2.5 and out the user in the zone, multiplying all further attacks by 1.2x and increasing the chance of a black flash to 5%. This chance is increased by 20% after landing a black flash."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, In Slot]Divergent Fist: Physical attacks deal a second magic based attack that deals half damage(can‘t get it working rn, so I have it as 1.5x damage as a place holder). On mastery, the original attack damage is multiplied by 2."
		""
		"[Active, Press] Simple Domain: Effect is applied to user that increase dodge chance to 50% and causes all incoming magic damage to be cut in half. Lasts for 30 seconds with 2 minute cooldown. 60 second CD on mastery. (All numbers are configurable)"
	]
	quest.6038ABE5182D3C77.title: "&f&lSoul Shrine"
	quest.604540C8539060C5.quest_desc: ["Goated for mobility"]
	quest.604540C8539060C5.quest_subtitle: "SO HIIIIGH"
	quest.604540C8539060C5.title: "Can We Get Much Higher??!"
	quest.611F5C80D71CC23B.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive, Toggle] Ultra Instinct"
		""
		"&0&lActives"
		"[Active, Press] Tribe Summon - The user can create allied Direwolves. This summons 1-3 (3-6 when mastered) that are loyal to the user, and house no name until the skill is mastered. Only 12 Direwolves can exist from this skill at a time."
		"Once the skill is mastered, the user can use the command /trnightmare pack name to name the pack of wolves."
		""
		"[Active, Hold] Tribe Regeneration - The user begins to regenerate themselves at a similar speed and cost to Ultraspeed Regeneration, when used while at full HP, it begins to heal all nearby Direwolves under the Pack Name."
		""
		"[Active, Press] Assimilation - The user can user Assimilation to merge with a subordinate, or if no subordinate is looked at, a member of their pack. This increases the user's stats by the stats of their Subordinate, and they gain access to all of their Skills while Assimilated."
		""
		"[Active, Press] Will Manipulation - The user can press this to send a command to the entire pack. Scroll to change commands:"
		"Neutral/passive/aggressive/protect"
		""
		"Note: Aggressive targetting: Attack if Entitiy is 1.Not allied 2.Over 10k EP"
	]
	quest.611F5C80D71CC23B.title: "&f&lLord of Magewolves"
	quest.613B4CD194E634AD.quest_subtitle: "I can sense you magicules!"
	quest.613B4CD194E634AD.title: "Gain Magic Sense"
	quest.6142CCA39B5B558D.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, Hold] Stagnate Aura - Costs 500 mp/s. While held, entities within a 25 block radius of the user cannot move or use physical/aura attacks. Mental/Magical/Skill based ones can still be used."
		""
		"[Active, Hold] Inaction - Costs 100mp/s. While Held, the user cannot move or use physical/aura based attacks, but can also not have their current HP reduced (SHP can still be reduced. Effects like that of Cook’s chaotic Fate can bypass this.)"
		""
		"[Active, Toggle] Stasis Coat - When used, grants severance to the user’s melee attacks, as well as +10 damage."
		""
		"[Active, Press] Stasis Shot - Costs 1000 mp. User launches an Air Projectile that Bypasses Armor, doing 5 damage and severing the target’s HP. The Projectile travels at a speed of 25 m/s Cooldown of 20 Seconds {This mode must be learned}"
	]
	quest.6142CCA39B5B558D.title: "&f&lStagnator"
	quest.61822AF0A58312A2.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.61822AF0A58312A2.quest_subtitle: "Time to mine"
	quest.61822AF0A58312A2.title: "Acquire Ancient Knowledge "
	quest.618A97A507BE9E5C.quest_desc: ["By dropping food near this sourcelink or having a pedisatal next to it and placing food on top, it will generate source by consuming food."]
	quest.6198FF5CA6543B24.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive, Toggle] Eye of Insight - When toggled on, gain the effects of Thought Acceleration and Magic Sense. Drains 50 Magicules every 5 seconds that this is toggled on."
		""
		"[Passive, True] Overuse:"
		"Using abilities from this skill will build up a counter. If the counter hits 10, it will strain the user’s eyes, putting the entire skill on cooldown for 180 seconds while the user recharges."
		"Resting for 15 seconds after an ability usage will reset the counter to zero."
		""
		"[Passive, True] Intangibility:"
		"The next attack you take will be dodged with 100% chance. For 5 seconds, you are intangible and immune to all attacks, as they simply pass through you. This includes projectiles. However, this passive goes on a 15 second cooldown after."
		"Will build up the counter if this is triggered."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, Held/Press] Ejection:"
		"Crouch and Press the ability key to open the ejection GUI. Store up to three different projectile types in your dimension here, up to 128 per stack. Holding the key will spawn portals. The user must charge for 3 seconds before they can fire, otherwise the portals will not be fully opened."
		"-Releasing the key forcefully ejects one projectile from EVERY SLOT in the GUI out at 3x speed than that of a bow would after a wind up, dealing increased damage. On mastery, you can now place 5 projectiles into your GUI."
		""
		"Will build up the counter if this is triggered. Additionally, the charge time is halved on mastery."
		""
		"[Active, Held] Authority of the Gods:"
		"Crouch using will allow you to bring yourself into the Kamui dimension over a period of time, determined by your player’s current size. For reference, a 2 block tall default sized player will take 2 seconds to warp into the dimension. Releasing crouch will cancel this process."
		""
		"On mastery, double the speed that it would take to transfer you into the dimension. You can also now target other entities provided they are within your interaction range. Will build up the counter if this is triggered."
		""
		"[Active (Mastery), Press] Intangibility: The user becomes able to control their intangibility. On pressing the key, become intangible for 5 seconds, allowing the user to walk straight through projectiles, as well as dodge ALL attacks. Cooldown of 10 seconds after it wears off."
	]
	quest.6198FF5CA6543B24.title: "&f&lPhaser"
	quest.629DD1CD3BA6F26B.title: "&f&lMai"
	quest.62C07A72131CE480.quest_desc: ["These wepons will give you the blue prints to forge even more powerful weapons in the future!"]
	quest.62C07A72131CE480.title: "&f&lForge These Weapons Of Destuction"
	quest.631F58EE30331DCD.quest_subtitle: "Only F rank and above can buy this"
	quest.633BD9617EF5283C.title: "&f&lObtain A Greater Spirit Of Earth"
	quest.6361B4A0352A1DFC.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassives"
		"Passive (true) - Weakened State"
		""
		"The user normally remains in a weakened body."
		""
		"Current Health and Magicules cannot exceed 95% of their true maximum."
		"The user is 5% smaller."
		"Activating Embers or Plus Ultra temporarily restores the user to heroic form."
		""
		"Passive (toggle) - I Am Here"
		""
		"Projects a 32-block presence that causes hostile creatures and creatures targeting the user to flee."
		""
		"Allies are unaffected."
		"Creatures attacked by the user ignore the aura for 30 seconds, allowing them to fight back."
		"The aura can be freely toggled on or off."
		" "
		"Passive (true) - Surpass Your Limits"
		""
		"Prevents the first ordinary death of each life and forces the user into Plus Ultra."
		""
		"Activates once per life."
		"Restores the user to 50% Health and 50% Magicules."
		"Grants Plus Ultra for 90 seconds."
		"Clears fire, fall distance, and current movement."
		"Plays the Plus Ultra voice line upon revival."
		"Damage that bypasses invulnerability cannot trigger the revival."
		"Resets only after the user genuinely dies and respawns."
		""
		"&0&lActives"
		"Active (press) - Embers"
		""
		"Temporarily restores the user to heroic form. Press again to end Embers early."
		""
		"Normal duration: 5 minutes"
		"Mastered duration: 10 minutes"
		"Cooldown: 10 minutes, beginning when heroic form ends"
		""
		"Doubles maximum Health and maximum Magicules."
		"Increases body size by 20%."
		"Increases all damage by 25%."
		"Basic melee attacks gain increased knockback."
		"Enables Delaware Smash, Texas Smash, United States of Smash, and Super Leap."
		"Damages nearby valid terrain on transformation, with ordinary block drops."
		"Current Health and Magicule percentages are preserved when entering or leaving the form."
		" "
		"Active (press) - Plus Ultra"
		""
		"Converts active Embers into a stronger heroic form."
		""
		"Requirement: Embers must be active"
		"Duration: Uses the remaining Embers duration at twice the normal rate"
		""
		"Doubles maximum Health and maximum Magicules."
		"Increases body size by 20%."
		"Doubles all damage."
		"Greatly increases basic melee knockback."
		"Basic melee hits create a small shockwave."
		"Cannot be canceled once activated."
		"Damages nearby valid terrain on transformation, with ordinary block drops."
		"When the form ends, inflicts Paralysis for 10 seconds and Weakness for 2 minutes."
		"Starts Embers' 10-minute cooldown when the form ends."
		""
		"Active (press) - Delaware Smash"
		""
		"Strikes one targeted enemy with a focused Smash, launching and Crippling them."
		""
		"Targeting range: 8 blocks with direct line of sight"
		"Base damage: 100, increased to 150 after mastery"
		"Magicule cost: 4,000"
		"Cooldown: 30 seconds"
		"Cripple duration: 10 seconds"
		""
		"Embers increases the damage by 25%."
		"Plus Ultra doubles the damage."
		"Cripple increases physical damage received by 25%."
		"Creates a small impact crater and drops valid broken blocks."
		"Grants 3 mastery on a successful hit."
		"Active (press) - Texas Smash"
		""
		"Releases a widening 14-block forward shockwave that damages and launches every enemy in its path."
		""
		"Base damage: 70, increased to 100 after mastery"
		"Magicule cost: 9,000"
		"Cooldown: 45 seconds"
		"Maximum half-width: 4 blocks"
		"Vertical reach: 4 blocks"
		""
		"Embers increases the damage by 25%."
		"Plus Ultra doubles the damage."
		"Deflects hostile projectiles caught in the shockwave."
		"Requires line of sight to damage an enemy."
		"Tears through valid terrain along its path and drops broken blocks."
		"Grants 2 mastery for the first target and 1 for each additional target, up to 5 mastery."
		""
		"Active (press) - United States of Smash"
		""
		"A mastery-only ultimate that launches the user upward, then forces them down into a massive ground-impact Smash."
		""
		"Only becomes visible after Symbol of Peace reaches 1,000 mastery."
		"Damage and effects occur when the user hits the ground, not when activated."
		"Magicule cost: 20,000, paid when the launch begins."
		"Cooldown: 20 minutes, beginning when the launch starts."
		"Impact radius: 24 blocks"
		"Vertical reach: 12 blocks"
		"Cripple duration: 30 seconds"
		"Maximum Health reduction duration: 60 seconds"
		"Heroic form cost: 1 displayed minute, consumed on impact"
		""
		"Damage scales from 50 to 300 at 1,000,000 EP while in Embers."
		"Damage scales from 50 to 400 at 1,000,000 EP while in Plus Ultra."
		"Scaling uses the greater of the user's recorded EP or total maximum Aura plus Magicule capacity."
		"Cripple increases physical damage received by 25%."
		"Reduces enemy maximum Health by 30% in Embers or 40% in Plus Ultra."
		"Applies heavy knockback to surviving enemies."
		"Creates expanding shockwaves and a 12.5-block crater."
		"Can break up to 512 valid blocks, with ordinary block drops."
		"If the slam is interrupted, its committed Magicule cost and cooldown remain spent, but impact effects and the one-minute form cost are not applied."
	]
	quest.6361B4A0352A1DFC.title: "&f&lSymbol Of Peace"
	quest.640AFCC3A00F47EC.quest_desc: [
		"&01- Be Majin subclass"
		""
		"&02-Have 200k EP"
		""
		"(1 and 2 make you a demon lord seed, after collecting 10k souls you can fully awaken)"
		"(Soul quantity collected is determined by how much ep the creature has)"
		"(You can wait to awaken but once your soul amount reaches 20,000 you will be forced into awakening)"
		""
		"&0After awakening the harvest festival will begin, you will experience the following for the next 3 min:"
		"."
		"* Within the first minute, the player will be unable to use any abilities and have limited vision/movement, all mob subordinates within range will be automatically set to Follow and Protect."
		""
		"* Reaching the second minute, the player will be sent into Sleep Mode instantly, unable to move or use any ability."
		""
		"*In the last minute, players subordinate and mobs subordinates (if within range) will be also automatically sent into Sleep Mode."
		""
		"*Dying during Harvest Festival will lead to the loss of all acquired souls"
		""
		"&2&lGains:"
		"Grants an 3x EP buff"
		"Double stats for subordinates (has to be npc subordinates, will not work on player)"
		"An Evolution to some NPC subordinates and certain player races (unsure if applies to all)"
		"Evolution of all applicable/current Resistances to Nullifications"
	]
	quest.640AFCC3A00F47EC.quest_subtitle: "&fGuide"
	quest.640AFCC3A00F47EC.title: "&4&lBecoming A Demon Lord"
	quest.6431AD90B9785988.title: "&f&lObtain A Medium Spirit Of Earth"
	quest.646E1EF9B59A0913.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive, Toggle] Under Orders:"
		"Your subjects are loyal and believe in your rule. Upon changing the targeting of a mob, grant them Inspiration I for 30 seconds. On mastery, this upgrades to Inspiration II for one minute."
		""
		"[Mastery, Passive, True] Powerful Control:"
		"Any spells or skills that place targets under your control no longer requires you to stare at them for long periods of time. This includes the following: Greed, Dominate, Demon Dominate, Demon Marionette"
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, Press] Takeover:"
		"On activation, the target you are looking at instantly gets placed under your control with no wind up. The target’s EP must be lesser than your amount of magicules and cannot exceed 600k EP. On acquiring more Mental Magic, this cap increases by 100k per."
		""
		"[Active, Press] Thought Domination (Movement):"
		"Allows the user to control their subordinate's movements in a radius around them. There are four available options, \"Follow\", \"Wander\", \"Stay\" and \"Meat Shield\"."
		""
		"[Active, Press] Thought Domination (Targeting):"
		"Allows the user to control their subordinate's entity targeting in a radius around them. There are four available options, \"Passive\", \"Aggressive\", \"Neutral\" and \"Protect\"."
	]
	quest.646E1EF9B59A0913.title: "&f&lSubjugator"
	quest.64F1C1F6615F13FB.title: "&f&lFind The Adventurer Guild"
