	quest.6A069E4E9033C99A.quest_desc: [
		"Here you can learn more about the unique abilities that are available. "
		""
		"If you are having trouble locating your skill hit ctrl + f and seach for its name. "
		""
		"The Tensura Wiki Book Also contains the informations to these uniques and many of the packs ultimate abilities"
		""
		"&0&lStill can't find it? - Please report in our discord server!"
	]
	quest.6A069E4E9033C99A.quest_subtitle: "&fInfo"
	quest.6A069E4E9033C99A.title: "&6&lUnique Wiki"
	quest.6A53188CF6C3CFD5.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive, True] Time Leap:"
		"The user will periodically \"save\" their location and data. If they were to die, they will return to their last random save. This has a 10 minute cooldown between uses"
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, Press] Reverse Fate(Requires Mastery, Requires Learning)"
		"When used, the user saves the current state of all thnigs within sixty blocks. On a second use, it loads everything back to that state. (5 minute cooldown)"
	]
	quest.6A53188CF6C3CFD5.title: "&f&lTime Traveler"
	quest.6A799016901DE1E3.quest_desc: [
		"When you kill an entity you will gain 3% of its ep (existance points) somtimes this number is bigger depending on certain skills"
		""
		"EP gets you MP (magical points- for magic/most skills) and AP (aura points-for battle wills), but the gain in each is dependent on your race"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Soul Energy (SE): Randomly generated upon first entering the world, with a 65% chance of starting between 500,000 and 1,000,000. It is consumed whenever a new unique ability is acquired."
		""
		"Increasing SE: SE can be increased by triggering Awakening, using a Reset Scroll, or being named"
		""
		"You can check yours by using: /mysticism get stat <username> soulEnergy current"
	]
	quest.6A799016901DE1E3.quest_subtitle: "&fGeneral Stater information"
	quest.6A799016901DE1E3.title: "&f&lImportant Progression Info"
	quest.6A902CE746FBC638.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassives"
		"Passive (True) - Durable Vessel"
		""
		"Grants +10 Armor."
		""
		"Multiplies all direct melee Physical Damage dealt by the user by 1.2×."
		""
		"Only genuine melee attacks qualify. Projectiles, skills, delayed impacts, and other indirect damage do not receive this multiplier."
		""
		"Passive (True) - Soul Awareness"
		""
		"Grants Tensura’s registered Spiritual Attack Resistance ability."
		""
		"Passive (True) - Battle Prowess"
		""
		"Whenever the user obtains a Battlewill, they skip its learning process and immediately reach its learned state. "
		"Passive (True) - Black Flash"
		""
		"While Divergent Fist is active, every qualifying melee strike has a chance to become a Black Flash."
		""
		"Base Chance"
		""
		"Normal: 2.5%"
		"Mastered: 5%"
		""
		"Each successful Black Flash raises the chance to the next tier:"
		""
		"Normal: 2.5% → 5% → 10% → 20% → 25% cap"
		""
		"Mastered: 5% → 10% → 20% → 35% cap"
		""
		"A successful Black Flash opens or refreshes a 15-second combo window."
		""
		"Each qualifying melee attack that does not become a Black Flash lowers the chance by one tier."
		""
		"The chance resets to its base value when:"
		""
		"The combo window expires."
		"Divergent Fist ends or is disabled."
		"The user dies."
		""
		"Black Flash prevents Divergent Fist’s normal delayed second impact."
		""
		"Instead, the original hit is followed immediately by additional Physical Damage equal to 2.5× the original damage actually inflicted, producing 3.5× total Physical Damage."
		""
		"It also deals Spiritual Damage equal to that 3.5× total, damaging both the target’s body and soul."
		""
		"Every Black Flash inflicts Soul Wound for 5 seconds and grants 15 Vessel mastery until Vessel reaches 1,000 mastery."
		""
		"Soul Wound"
		""
		"Prevents the target from regenerating or restoring SHP. Its SHP remains locked to the lowest value reached while the wound is active. "
		""
		""
		"&0&lActives"
		"Active (Press) - Divergent Fist"
		""
		"Activation Cost: 4,000 Magicules"
		"Duration: 3 minutes"
		"Cooldown: 1 minute after it ends"
		""
		"While active, qualifying melee attacks produce a second impact approximately 0.3 seconds later."
		""
		"The second impact:"
		""
		"Deals additional Physical Damage equal to 50% of the original damage actually inflicted*."
		"Deals an equal amount of Spiritual Damage, giving the second impact a 1:1 Physical-to-Spiritual ratio."
		""
		"Only direct melee attacks can activate Divergent Fist."
		""
		"A qualifying attack must reach 100% attack strength. Projectiles, skills, secondary damage, and Divergent Fist’s own delayed impact cannot activate it again."
		""
		"Divergent Fist and Black Flash can trigger no more than once every 0.5 seconds. Weapons that fully recharge faster may still attack normally, but cannot create more than two Divergent Fist or Black Flash events per second."
		""
		"Each impact costs 0.5% of maximum Magicules. "
		""
		"Vessel’s Spiritual Damage bypasses Spiritual Attack Resistance. Spiritual Attack Nullification can stop it, but is degraded by the attack."
		""
		"After Mastery"
		""
		"Divergent Fist becomes an active toggle with no duration limit."
		""
		"While toggled:"
		""
		"Drains 0.1% of maximum Magicules per second."
		"Removes the individual 0.5% impact cost."
		"Infuses attacks with Tensura’s Severance effect."
		"Ends automatically if the drain cannot be paid."
		""
		"Disabling it still begins the one-minute cooldown. "
		"Active (Press) - Relentless Pursuit"
		""
		"Cooldown: 2 minutes"
		"Magicule Cost: None"
		""
		"When looking at a living entity within 25 blocks, the user rushes to a position slightly above the target before slamming downward and dealing 3× melee damage."
		""
		"If no entity is targeted, the user instead rushes up to 30 blocks forward with a slight upward tilt."
		""
		"Active (Press) - Soul Punch"
		""
		"Requires Divergent Fist to be active."
		""
		"The user performs a heavy soul-infused melee attack that:"
		""
		"Deals 2× melee damage."
		"Damages the target’s Spiritual Health through Vessel’s spiritual-damage rules."
		"launches the target backward."
		"Inflicts Soul Wound for 10 seconds."
		""
		"Cooldown: 1 minute"
		""
		"minimum range of three blocks."
	]
	quest.6A902CE746FBC638.title: "&f&lVessel"
	quest.6B69365E0A10AABA.quest_desc: [
		"&6&lObtainment"
		"Cost 10M EP"
		"Adaptability mastered"
		""
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive, true] Adaption:"
		"Upon being hit, master the resistance to that damage type"
		"2 hits grant the Tensura nullification"
		"3 Hits make the user bypass the resistance of that type"
		"4 Degrade the null"
		"5 Bypass the null"
		"Upon being inflicted with an Effect once, become immune AFTER the effect took effect"
		"Adapt to severance (not cook) after being hit"
		"Cannot Adapt to Infinity Prison"
		""
		"[Passive, Toggle] Adaption usage"
		"Enables the recording of Adaptions"
		""
		"[Passive, Toggle] Infinite regen"
		"No change in cost"
		""
		"[Passive, True] Learning"
		"+50 mastery and learn points"
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, Press] Sword of Extermination"
		"(Re)Summons sword of extermination 1Mill perm. AP cost"
		""
		"[Active, Press] Adapted"
		"Lets the user disable or enable effect immunities"
		"Lets user dis/enable Damage Adaptions"
	]
	quest.6B69365E0A10AABA.title: "&4&lDivine General Mahoraga"
	quest.6C1804A263AF84C9.title: "&f&lEvolve Into An A-Rank Calamity"
	quest.6C5837A771CA4E5C.quest_desc: [
		"Arcane core in center, enchating appraratus on top of the core, and then 8 pedestals around forming a crafting table structure."
		""
		"If you right click the enchanting appraratus, purple  points can be seen where successfully connected."
	]
	quest.6C5837A771CA4E5C.quest_subtitle: "&f&lPlace"
	quest.6C695DA1A1B4A980.quest_desc: ["Spawns a physical barrier in front of the caster that blocks incoming attacks and projectiles."]
	quest.6C695DA1A1B4A980.title: "&f&lShield"
	quest.6CB623EA90C884ED.quest_subtitle: "Reach rank d before you proceed"
	quest.6CB623EA90C884ED.title: "&f&lRank Up To D"
	quest.6CC8BB71469C5679.quest_desc: [
		"&6&lWhen Mastered and having the starved ability preditor evolves into Glottony"
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Press] - Predation: On use, creates a black mist (breath) in a 2 block radius in front of the player. If it comes into contact with a mob, deals 10 damage and drains 100 MP, with a 10% chance to gain one random intrinsic, common, extra, or resistance skill from the target. If an enemy is killed by Predation, gains all of their intrinsic, common, extra, and resist skills. With Mastery, the mist is capable of eating projectiles. If a magic projectile is eaten, then the player gains that magic (consumed attacks have their ep added to stomach's energy storage). 50% chance to copy eligible magics when consuming a target. Targets killed/corpses eaten have 50% of their ep added to the players, instead of the usual 5% (EP absorb only applies for the first target of that type using Predator) The other 50% will be added to Stomach's energy storage. Shift-activate to toggled on/off consume-block-mode, which will automatically be added to Stomach."
		""
		"[Active - Press] - Stomach: When activated, grants access to a spatial storage with the size of a chest with 7 rows. Items are able to be stacked to 128 instead of 64."
		""
		"[Active - Press] - Isolation: Consumes held item and restores MP similar to Absorb and Dissolve, but with twice the restored MP. If nothing is held and the player is looking at a target, remove all negative status effects from that target. If used while empty handed and not looking at a mob, removes all negative status effects from the player [Costs 100MP each effect level removed]."
		""
		"[Active - Press] - Analysis: Opens an analysis GUI functioning similarly to Great Sage's refinement subskill excluding the function for automation and saving item on closing GUI."
	]
	quest.6CC8BB71469C5679.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.6CC8BB71469C5679.title: "&f&lPredator"
	quest.6D598790FF79CECB.quest_subtitle: "Its Almost like RCT?!"
	quest.6D598790FF79CECB.title: "&5&lWOW The regen Is almost Instant"
	quest.6DB03448063C4811.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassives"
		""
		"Passive (true) - Weakling"
		"- Increases attack damage received by 10%."
		"- At mastery, the increase is reduced to 5%."
		""
		"Passive (true) - Return by Death"
		"- Begins each true life with 3 (5 stocks when mastered) natural Return stocks."
		"- While a natural stock remains, lethal damage consumes one stock and cancels the death."
		"- Natural Returns restore Health, Magicules and Aura to 50% (60% when mastered) of their maximum values."
		"- The rewind prefers a safe recorded position roughly 9 sec earlier"
		"- If that window is unavailable, it can use an older safe position recorded at least 3 sec earlier."
		"- Return by Death can continue after all natural stocks have been exhausted by consuming the user's Magicules:"
		""
		"Unmastered:"
		""
		"Requires at least 90% of maximum Magicules."
		"Restores Health and Aura to 50%."
		"Resets Magicules to 50%."
		""
		"Mastered:"
		""
		"Requires at least 60% of maximum Magicules."
		"Restores Health and Aura to 60%."
		"Resets Magicules to 40%."
		""
		"Natural stock recovery:"
		""
		"Recovers one spent stock every 3 minutes(1.5 min after mastery)"
		"Natural and emergency Returns both increase Trauma and strengthen Witch's Scent."
		" "
		"Passive (true) - Trauma"
		"- Repeated Returns during the same true life cause increasingly severe consequences."
		"- Returns 1–4: no Trauma penalty."
		"- Returns 5–9: Nausea for 15 sec after each Return."
		"- Returns 10–14: Nausea and Weakness for 30 sec after each Return."
		"- Return 15 and beyond activates Breaking Point after every Return."
		"- Breaking Point applies Nausea, Weakness and Slowness."
		"- Breaking Point lasts 45 sec normally / 30 sec when mastered."
		"- The Return counter resets only after an actual death and respawn."
		""
		"Passive (true) - Witch's Scent"
		"- Forces nearby neutral and hostile mobs to prioritize the Witch Knight."
		"- Base radius: 12 blocks normally / 8 blocks when mastered."
		"Each Return during the current life adds 1 block normally / 0.5 blocks when mastered (capped at +8 blocks)."
		""
		"Passive (toggle) - Cor Leonis"
		""
		"Connects the Witch Knight to recognized allies and bears part of their suffering."
		""
		"Link radius: 24 blocks normally / 32 blocks when mastered."
		"Linked allies are outlined in gold."
		"Transfers 25% of a linked ally's final incoming damage to the user."
		"At mastery, the transferred amount becomes 35%."
		"Transferred damage can trigger Return by Death."
		"When a linked ally defeats an eligible enemy, the Witch Knight gains 6% of the defeated enemy's EP."
		"Cor Leonis has no Magicule cost or cooldown and remains active until toggled off or the link is broken."
		""
		"&0&lActives"
		"Active (press) - Shamak"
		""
		"Creates a burst of darkness centered on the user."
		""
		"Radius: 8 blocks normally / 16 blocks when mastered."
		"Affected players see complete blackness, have entity outlines suppressed and receive an on-screen duration countdown."
		"Affected mobs immediately lose their target, stop navigating and cannot reacquire a target while Pure Blindness remains active."
		"Hostile mobs receive 5 sec of Pure Blindness normally / 10 sec when mastered."
		"Players receive 5 sec normally / 10 sec when mastered."
		"A player whose maximum EP is at least 20% higher than the caster's resists Shamak twice as quickly."
		"These stronger players are blinded for 2.5 sec normally / 5 sec when Shamak is mastered."
		"Cost: 7,500 Magicules."
		"Cooldown: 100 sec normally / 50 sec when mastered."
		""
		"Active (tap / hold) - Invisible Providence"
		""
		"Manifests one invisible hand from the user's chest. The hand is visible only to the Witch Knight."
		""
		"Tap - Strike:"
		""
		"Strikes the first valid target in the user's line of sight."
		"Range: 6 blocks normally / 10 blocks when mastered."
		"Deals 50 damage normally / 80 when mastered."
		"Interrupts item use and mob navigation."
		"Violently knocks the target backward"
		""
		"Hold - Grab:"
		""
		"Holding for roughly 0.35 sec commits to a grab attempt."
		"Restrains one valid target for up to 2 sec normally / 3 sec when mastered."
		"Uses the same 6-block normal / 10-block mastered range."
		"Stops item use, applies severe Slowness, halts mob targeting and pulls the victim toward the user."
		"Releasing the key ends the grab early."
		""
		"General:"
		""
		"Costs 2,500 Magicules."
		"Cooldown: 20 sec normally / 15 sec when mastered."
		"Successful use inflicts 10 direct recoil damage normally / 5 when mastered."
	]
	quest.6DB03448063C4811.title: "&f&lWitch Knight"
	quest.6E00C888F1B99D0E.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive, True] Multi-Threading- User is capable of running/chanting 2 abilities simultaneously. (This is moved to 3 on mastery.)"
		""
		"[Passive, True] Rapid Access Memory - Using a spell again within a 5 seconds or less window of using it while \"Allocate\" is enabled will instant cast it. {RAM is cleared every 5 seconds, so there is no guarantee you will have a full 5 seconds to use it}"
		""
		"[Passive, Toggled] Thought Acceleration - Divide casting time by 2 in most cases and increase invulnerability frames from dodging by 1."
		"On mastery, casting time is decreased by that same factor for each 'Thread' you put into it along with I-Frames being increased."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, Press/Toggle] Allocate -Using this allows you to allocate you extra Thread(s) into using 1 ability, effectively turning off the ability to multi-cast. Use the ability normally to activate and shift use it to deactivate it. (On mastery, when not using any active abilities, they will be allocated into thought acceleration.)"
		""
		"[Active, Press] Overclock - Requires Mastery - Increase strength of all of this skill's capabilities by thirty percent for 40 seconds, disables the entire skill afterwards for 5 Minutes so it can 'cool down'. (Having Heat resistance allows you to shift use it for the same amount of time and same cooldown but with a fifty percent boost, or use it normally for a thirty percent boost for 1 minute and disabling the skill for 3 minutes and 20 seconds. Heat nullification allows the 50% with the lower cooldown and higher time.)"
	]
	quest.6E00C888F1B99D0E.title: "&f&lProcessor"
	quest.6E3A923C33B007C4.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive - In Slot] Recall - Restore 0.5% of MP every 5 seconds. On mastery, this upgrades to 1%."
		""
		"[Passive - True] Lucid Dream: Death is not the end. If the player had set a Dream before dying, instantly teleport to the location of the Dream, restore all stats, and cheat death. The (Dream) mode goes on a cooldown of 1200 seconds when this happens. (On mastery, reduces to 900 seconds.)"
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, Press] Dream:"
		"Save your current health, SHP, magicules, aura, and location. Reactivating Dream will restore your stats back to the saved values and instantly teleport you to the location you saved. When activated, go on a 1200 second cooldown. (On mastery, reduces to 900 seconds.) Dying will also trigger Dream if you've saved one, see [Lucid Dream]. Crouching and activating will cancel the dream."
		""
		"[Active, Held] Hypnosis - Induce Drowsiness I (Drowsiness II when mastered) on mobs in a 10 block radius (15 when mastered). All values can be modified in the configuration files."
		""
		"[Active, Held] Dream Eater:"
		"Holding down the skill while looking at a mob that is Drowsy will deal 30 damage (50 when mastered) and 30 spiritual damage (50 when mastered) after a 5 second timer. Successfully consuming a dream will reduce (Dream)'s cooldown by 30 seconds. Grants a mastery point as well. All values are configurable in the configuration files."
	]
	quest.6E3A923C33B007C4.title: "&f&lDreamer"
	quest.6E7646ECBE6BB0BD.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive, Acquisition] Knowledge of the Ages:"
		"On acquisition of [Scholar], the user instantly learns all Schematics, provided that the skill is permanent and not temporary."
		""
		"[Passive, Toggle] Quick Reader - All of the user's learning and mastery speeds is increased by +6."
		"[Passive, In Slot] Study - On being attacked, you have a 20% chance by default to gain a Study Point for that specific attacker entity type. Each Study Point you have will increase your innate dodge chance towards that specific entity type up to a maximum of 50% (75% on mastery). Each Study Point increases your dodge chance for that entity type by 2%."
		"If the attacker is a player, you will instead gain dodge for THAT player, and not players in general. This can go up to 20% when unmastered, and 40% when mastered."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, Press] Library of Babel:"
		"Open a book storage GUI. In this menu, the user may only deposit books, such as book and quills, normal books, written books or enchanted books. By placing an enchanted book in a slot, the user may right click that slot to open an upgrading menu, allowing the user to choose which level they would like to upgrade or downgrade that book's level to."
		""
		"Be mindful that upgrading a book utilises MAXIMUM magicules and not CURRENT. This can go up to five levels past the limit, with the cost increasing for each level of enchantment."
	]
	quest.6E7646ECBE6BB0BD.title: "&f&lScholar"
	quest.6F03C37A8BB77015.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.6F03C37A8BB77015.quest_subtitle: "Only F rank and above can purchase this"
