	quest.7418E2D1709539B0.quest_desc: [
		"If you are playing alone you could either plunder this from a Snow Golem or use the Ice And Fire mod since getting hit by ice dragons ice breath helps you get this, though you should have a way to get Fragility as normally they don't do enough damage, can make fragility potions or use the Shrink Spell. Or Make an Ice Blade and drop it so a mob will pick it up and hit you with it."
		""
		"When toggled, it nullifies the effects of Chill and prevents Cold damage if it falls below 50% of your Max HP. If the attack is not below 50% of your Max HP the damage will be halved."
	]
	quest.7418E2D1709539B0.quest_subtitle: "&f&lTips"
	quest.7418E2D1709539B0.title: "&#2236CD&lCold Resistance"
	quest.746647D0C76A5E2F.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive, In-Slot] Solicitation (Requires Mastery):"
		"While this skill is in-slot and mastered, the user will be able to copy sub-skills similarly to Pride."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, Press] Charm:"
		""
		"[Active, Press] Temptation World:"
		"The user traps all nearby entities with Charm or Fear in their Illusion. The world becomes dark around them, and they can only see a couple blocks in front of them. Entities with Spiritual Nullification and higher EP than the user can ignore this effect."
		""
		"[Active, Press] Reality Exchange (Requires Mastery):"
		"The user pulls all targets inflicted by Temptation World into the Temptation Dimension. The dimension is a dark void, with very little ground to move in."
		""
		"[Active, Press] Solicitation (Requires Mastery, Requires Learning):"
		"The user opens their Solicitation Menu, which allows them to use the modes of copied skills from Tempter, only in the Temptation Dimension."
		""
		"[Active, Press] End Of World (Requires Mastery, Requires Learning):"
		"The user collapses the Temptation Dimension in on itself, with a white flash. This deals 1,000 Spiritual Damage to all entities inside of it, including the user. This is reduced to 500 if your EP is within 50% of the user's EP. If your EP is less than 30% of the users, this will instantly kill you."
	]
	quest.746647D0C76A5E2F.title: "&f&lTempter"
	quest.748473109EA88A68.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lA Resistance Skill refers to skills that make you immune to elements and effects"
		""
		"&6&lResistances are split into difficulties(easy/medium/hard) with different requirements to obtain"
		"Easy: 5+ damage at once for 1 learning point and 350 points to fully learn."
		""
		"Medium: 15+ damage at once for 1 learning point and 500 points to fully learn."
		""
		"Hard: 20+ damage at once for 1 learning point and 700 points to fully learn."
		""
		"&8&lThe default difficulties for each resistance is:"
		"Easy: Corrosion, Poison, Paralysis"
		""
		"Medium: Pain, Pierce, Natural Attack (7 main elementals + Gravity, Lightning, Heat, Cold) and Holy."
		""
		"Hard: Physical Attack, Magic, Spiritual and Abnormal."
		""
		"&4&lResistance can also be learnt from damage under the thresholds and accumulating this to 10x the amount of damage to get a point."
		"For example, Physical Attack Resistance requires 20+ damage at once to gain 1 point:"
		""
		"If players take less than 20 damage, for example 12 damage, the skill won't gain a learning point, but 12 \"damage points\", once this \"damage points\" "
		"value reaches 200 (20 x10), the skill will gain 1 learning point."
		""
		"Each time the skill gains 1 learning point, the \"damage points\" resets to 0."
		""
		"&f&lWhen toggled on resistances nullify the effects of their specific ailments / nullify damage tacken if less than or equal to half your max hp (if the damage is more you only take half of it)"
	]
	quest.748473109EA88A68.quest_subtitle: "&fResistance Acquirement"
	quest.748473109EA88A68.title: "&1&lGeneral Resistance Guide"
	quest.74FE90763E85C6E2.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[True] IQ of 530K"
		"Thought Acceleration"
		"(Sage obtain with mastery)"
		""
		"[Toggle]"
		"Passive Mastery"
		""
		"[In slot] Though Guy"
		"Resistance 5"
		"Strength 5"
		""
		"&0&lActives"
		"[Press] Enxchange"
		"On press, switch 2 chosen entities (80 blocks radius)"
		"Normal: Yourself + What you look at"
		"Sneak: 2 random entities"
		""
		"[Press] Target Select"
		"Upon press, Save up to 3 entities as target when punching them"
		"Holding a projectile while using selects it as target"
		"Using Exchange uses these as target"
		"Sneak to unselect all targets"
	]
	quest.74FE90763E85C6E2.title: "&f&lBoogie Woogie"
	quest.7519BEB1FFC05D16.quest_desc: ["Reliable, burst-style scaling recovery."]
	quest.7519BEB1FFC05D16.title: "&f&lGreater Heal"
	quest.7574D58B8846221F.quest_desc: ["It grants total invulnerability for a set duration, delaying all incoming damage until it expires (and only dealing 50% of it). It allows players to survive a literal one-shot."]
	quest.7574D58B8846221F.title: "&f&lHeartstop"
