	quest.77658E4614E08B7F.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive, True] Spiritron Collection - The user gains a new Energy bar below their MP and AP Bars, this containts the user's Spiritron Point Bar. This bar will passively fill up so long as the user's MP is at 90% or higher. The Spiritron bar will regenerate 1 Spiritron a second (5 when mastered) and has a maximum size of 100."
		""
		"[Passive, In-slot] Purified Attacks - While the user's SP Bar is at 50 or higher, the user does Holy Damage 20 Holy Damage (40 when mastered) on hitting an entity with physical damage."
		""
		"[Passive, Toggled] Holy Miracle - When toggled, the user will increase all Holy Damage by +25 (+75 when mastered), but the user 50 (25 when mastered) damage whenever they deal Holy Damage."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, Held] Disintegration - The user begins to chant and Disintegration spell, using 75 Spiritrons to cast, along with 25,000 MP the user uses Disintegration, which does 150 Holy Damage."
		""
		"[Active, Press] Melt Cut (Requires Mastery) - The user coats their blade in Holy Magic, allowing them to deal Holy Damage by attacking an enemy. This deals 75 Holy Damage on hit, with a 1 second cooldon."
	]
	quest.77658E4614E08B7F.title: "&f&lSaint"
	quest.777CE20456AC0346.title: "&f&lShogo"
	quest.77A69A9195160B23.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lActive"
		""
		"[Active - Press] - Dummy Sword: At the cost of 100 MP, creates a Spatial Blade (with Severance V - X with mastery) in an empty hand slot. Blades infinitely regenerate at the cost of 20 MP per blade."
		""
		"[Active - Press] - Blade Storm: Require Spatial Blade to be in 1 of the user’s hand. At the cost of 2000 MP, unleashes 5 (10 with mastery) Severance Blades from behind the user to looked-at target (max range 20 blocks - 30 with Mastery). Cooldown 5s (3s with mastery)."
		""
		"[Active - Press] - Severance: Applies a severance effect and a 10 (30 with Mastery) damage boost to the player's attacks for 120 seconds. Costs 200 MP."
	]
