	quest.781A7069F8158CD1.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Press] - Coating: Costs 1,000 MP, adds a 50 (200 if mastered) damage boost, as well as a severance effect to the player's attacks for 60 seconds."
		""
		"Resist Bypass: Bypasses Resistances and treats Nullifications as Resistances while coat is active."
		""
		"[Active - Press] - Projectile: Costs 20,000 MP, launches an invisible projectile that deals 50 (300 with Mastery) Damage and has a severance effect. Projectile is 5 blocks(10 with mastery). 3s Cooldown"
	]
