		"[Passive - Toggle] - Predictive Calculation : 25% Chance to dodge an attack. 50% Chance to ignore dodge on enemies. 75% to deal Crit damage. Nullification is treated as resistance and resistance is bypassed. Magic Jamming's damage mitigation is ignored."
		""
