	quest.7A165817582AE42D.quest_desc: [
		"It is caused by any of the follow projectiles: arrow, spear, kunai or trident."
		""
		"It is caused by a living entity wielding a weapon in their main hand, these can be: a spear or a trident."
		""
		"The attack must deal 20+ damage"
		""
		"Go to the Spirit Tree and get someone to beat you up with a spear"
		""
		"If you are playing alone you could just let Lizardmen hit you for this since they have spears"
