	quest.7ADC623AC59CBDFC.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive - Toggle] Jealous Luck : 10% auto-dodge chance, Luck III, immune to Weakness and Slowness."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Press] Absorb: Can only be activated on a target with a higher EP than the player - Success rate based on user’s EP / target’s EP: <10% => 10%, 10-20% => 20%, >20% => 30%. Attempt to lower the target’s EP to be the same as the player, with the difference being returned to the player. 50% of the EP absorbed this way is converted into Maximum EP and the other 50% is only temporary MP and AP. [60% of the time will take half the available EP, 40% of the time will achieve full effect - maximum amount is 1M EP] - 30s cooldown (10s with mastery)."
		""
		"[Active - Hold] Strength Sap: In a 30x30 block radius around the user (Can be resisted if the user has 60% (80% with mastery) of the magicules of the target or more), applies 10 seconds of Weakness, Slowness for each 10% difference [50-60% level 1, 40-50% level 2, 30-40% level 6,..., 0-10% level 6]; also drain MP/AP at 0.1% per second of the affected entity which doesn't go to the user. Has 20% chance to increase 1 level of Insanity for the user (lasts 12s) every 10 seconds. Costs 1000 magicules per second."
	]
