	quest.7B3A1F53FEA5D5D9.quest_desc: [
		"&fOnce your Dwarf Reputation (DR) reaches 100 or -100, you may use the Teleport Slab in the Royal Tower to challenge Gazel Dwargo. Your reputation determines how he treats you:"
		""
		"&4Criminal Path (-100 DR): Treated as an enemy. You must defeat Gazel in a high-stakes execution battle to earn the Five-Petal Strike Manual. Warning: The Teleport Slab will be disabled for you after this fight."
		""
		"&2Hero Path (+100 DR): Treated as an honored friend. You are welcomed for training and granted the Five-Petal Strike for free upon winning. You may return to challenge the King as often as you like."
		""
		"&f&lBy claiming the reward after pressing the checkmark will reveal your current rep in chat"
	]
