	quest.7CA6848F4379551C.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive, True] Fever Pitch - After using Performance, switch to the Truth mode, and vice versa."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, Held] Performance - Charm all non-allied entities in your presence in a 20 block radius, costing 250 MP/s to use. This Charm will wear off after 30 seconds and cannot be re-applied. Upon completing your performance, [Fever Pitch] activates. Addtionally, go on a 60 second cooldown. (I think the charm on this mode is bugged atm but do let me know)"
		"All entities allied to you will gain Inspiration instead."
		"The maximum time you can Perform for is 15 seconds."
		""
		"[Active, Press, Lie Mode] Masquerade - Tell a lie so grand it could become a truth. Hide the pain behind a dazzling smile that blinds the audience! Restore 25% HP and SHP of all allied entities in a 20 block radius and grant a slight speed buff to allies as well."
		""
		"[Active, Press, Truth Mode] Unveil - Reveal the darkness, pain and sadness in your heart, paralyzing non-allied entities in a 10 block radius in fear for 10 seconds. On mastery, additionally grants Marked For Death for the same duration. Cooldown of 30 seconds and costs 500 MP to use."
		""
		"[Mastery, Active, Press] Star Power - The six pointed star awakens. Grant all non-allied entities looking at you the Dazzled effect, freezing them in place for 10 seconds, making them unable to look away! Cooldown of 40 seconds."
	]
	quest.7CA6848F4379551C.quest_subtitle: "&fUsage"
	quest.7CA6848F4379551C.title: "&f&lCaptivator"
	quest.7CFEA7F244CAF664.quest_subtitle: "Be sure to find these and use em"
	quest.7D67E7D5C2A0A20F.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive, True] Heavens Favor - Changes the normal MP gain of 3% to 10% (15% on mastery) on killing a mob. Overrides any EP gamerules."
		""
		"[Passive, In Slot] - Martial Prodigy - Battle wills can be learned instantly and gain a flat 50 (100 when mastered) to attack damage while holding no weapon in either hands."
		""
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, Press] Breakthrough - Every 1000 mob kills, you gain a Breakthrough level, allowing you to temporarily boost MP gain by 3x for 5 minutes. You also temporarily gain Strengthen 15 and Resistance 5 during these 5 minutes. After using Breakthrough, go on a 1 hour cooldown. Gain 100 mastery points every time you use Breakthrough."
	]
	quest.7D67E7D5C2A0A20F.title: "&f&lCultivator"
	quest.7D8187C8D44402A1.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lPassive"
		"[Passive, Toggle] Chant Reduction - If a spell is not mastered, your cast speed is incredibly reduced through the spirits assistance."
		""
		"[Passive, Toggle] Chant Annulment - You no longer require chanting to cast any magic if the spell is mastered."
		""
		"[Passive, In Slot] Spiritfarer - The spirits protect you, reducing all magic and spiritual damage by 25%. Physical attacks are reduced by 10%."
		""
		"[Passive, In Slot] Leyline Connection - All magicule consumption is halved."
		""
		"[Passive, True] Harvester - Passively gain Souls through kills, even if you are not a Majin."
		""
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active, Press] Carve - Spin the Ritual Scythe, harvesting Souls in an area around you. The amount of souls gained is dependent on the damage dealt. Cooldown of 10 seconds. Earn 1 mastery point on usage."
		"The Soul formula is as follows: (Mainhand Weapon Damage + Base Atk Dmg) x Critical Multiplier (typically 1.5) / 5"
		""
		"[Active, Scroll] Enhance - The souls of the dead help you. While holding down this mode, scroll to choose a percentage of your souls to use on your next Magic/Spiritual attack which will boost it's damage by that percentage, +10%."
		"Example:"
		""
		"Solar Rain deals 30 per bolt. Assume you have 8 bolts in one usage of Solar Rain. By default, this will deal 30 x 8 = 240 damage. Using 100% of your souls, you will deal +33 (110%) for each bolt resulting in 63 x 8 = 504 damage. If I set the level to 50%, it would instead be +60% damage. So on, so forth."
	]
	quest.7D8187C8D44402A1.title: "&f&lSpiritualist"
	quest.7DEEC91479AF671C.quest_desc: [
		"&0&lActive"
		"[Active - Press]: Opens the Imitator menu, allowing the player to view and select entities they have previously defeated. A cooldown of 30 minutes starts when the user imitates an entity."
		""
		"Obtaining:"
		""
		"Other: Reincarnation / Skill Reroll"
		""
		"Player: Yes"
		""
		"Race: Any"
		""
		"Notes / Mechanics:"
		""
		"Collects a list of all imitable entities the player has killed (including mods like Mysticism or Not Enough Bosses if loaded)."
		""
		"List of entities (You are able to imitate them and get their Unique Skills temporarily):"
		"Hinata Sakaguchi"
		"Shogo Taguchi"
		"Shizu"
